<node id="&quot;FIVE-YEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DURATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The duration of the revolving credit agreement indicating a long-term financial commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific term length of the revolving credit agreement, which is five years."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term of the credit agreement is specifically defined as five years, specifying the duration of the loan facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term of the credit agreement which lasts for five years, indicating the duration of the lending arrangement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3186497d03f3092b42183853ddc9b9f03466d36a63153a16631500122b8f7ba3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ee06cf91e33fee41c9599d67414d8c9424c943cafc1d99ea76d0e5fd4a8ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab54d282afa20f44f00b37cd84f11005cd3fdccc4b3be509b64ac7c55cc6a205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaa7077c66782daef681356b6e76dae16df17215fc1d1321a33b3ecdffbef312</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All lenders are referred to collectively, which includes Citibank, N.A. as the appointed Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower represents and warrants to the Lenders that it has been authorized to execute, deliver, and perform its obligations under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower shall repay to the Lenders on the Maturity Date the aggregate principal amount of Loans made to such Borrower and outstanding on the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or financial institutions that provide loans to Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that provide loans under the terms of the agreement, having specific rights and obligations regarding the loan provision."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that provide loans, referenced collectively as part of the Credit Parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial institutions providing loans to the Company through the Agreement and their affiliates involved in lending."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial institutions providing loans to the borrower under the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are financial institutions providing loans under the credit agreement and are obligated to maintain confidentiality of certain information as defined in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are the entities that provide financing to the Borrowers and need to be notified by the Administrative Agent regarding any changes to Aggregate Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are the financial parties that provide loans and are entitled to enforce the terms of the Guarantee Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders are entities that provide financing and are involved in the approval processes related to changes in the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders are the financial institutions that provide Loans under the credit facility and must approve any new Designated Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders provide financing in the form of Loans and Commitments as part of the transactions contemplated in this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entities providing the revolving credit facility to the Company as outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial institutions providing the loan under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial institutions providing the loans under the agreement, receiving repayments in accordance with their respective Applicable Percentages."&lt;SEP&gt;"The group of financial institutions providing loans under the revolving credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-147a7244e05e5e0a792e28cc6e5a66776b68530e7b78e657803cca8165c2a30c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e19eeb4d91d88a819da58ff7f22334afcbd8b4e79c861858ec896b44ba553485&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662d9179320cf820c5a366528a40024cf7419d4e2a73a789f30004737c357c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2997033e9e9586a5d8ae522596b79da333d35edef15546a52e86c722b6d5025e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-417eddcd0bab337766c282a68bfd9bea2d8a4343e248436f5d44e16731bcff52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-520efb27c71261258643d7e53341822e6e3ec69de9e97532a2b9bb4fc458a6c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff5e2434da655a2671e0dad2380df7ed33831a7ffce6ba8ccd31c237a80d8f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed45c6c96103ab059aceb21c9095ebdb108ab095fa5004a7e6ef0bf873513bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd13e9cff4b44f1f996d575f0a8ec72755a2ea622bac476546165cd09900b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e50be65db4b6ac7ec46a8f1cad6186244bcd63f2e5df406958ff61986d1b2af4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
