<node id="&quot;AVAILABLE TENOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Available Tenor refers to the specific timeframes applicable for determining interest rates in credit agreements, highlighting a crucial aspect of calculating borrowings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The periods available for which the Benchmark can be set, necessary for calculating new rates when the Benchmark is replaced."&lt;SEP&gt;"The various lengths of time available for interest rate calculation under the Benchmark settings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45f901a85d933dee59c32c998d5ea513737e15aac20ae73ca0247bde1f35d2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831</data>
