</node>
<node id="&quot;EURIBO SCREEN RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate per annum equal to the euro interbank offered rate administered by the European Money Market Institute, for applicable periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"the relevant benchmark rate for loans or borrowings denominated in Euro."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406</data>
