</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT GOVERNMENTAL BODY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An authority that may suggest or impose changes in methodology for spread adjustments related to Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The authority responsible for the supervision and establishment of loan conventions and standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-45f901a85d933dee59c32c998d5ea513737e15aac20ae73ca0247bde1f35d2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407</data>
