</node>
<node id="&quot;EURIBOR BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A borrowing type that is influenced by the Euro Interbank Offered Rate, utilized in Euro-denominated financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any borrowing comprised of EURIBOR Loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736</data>
