</node>
<node id="&quot;REVALUATION DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the date associated with loans in alternative currencies, specifying when interest periods commence."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Revaluation Date is specified as a reference point for determining the US Dollar Equivalent of any Loan denominated in an Alternative Currency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca</data>
