<node id="&quot;INDEMNITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The indemnity under Section 11.04(c) represents the obligation of the Lender to compensate for certain losses or damages as outlined in the Agreement."</data>
