<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Business Day is a designated day for financial transactions, on which loan activities may occur as specified in the Loan Notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Business Day is defined as a day that is not a weekend or holiday when business operations are conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Business Day is defined as a day when financial institutions are open for general business in New York City, relevant for timing aspects related to the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A defined period during which financial institutions and organizations operate, impacting payment processing timelines."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any day that is not a weekend or public holiday, referenced in the context of payment and due dates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day refers to any day on which financial institutions are open for business, affecting the timing of payment due dates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days defined by the agreement wherein banking transactions can occur."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined working days that influence operational processes such as interest calculations and payment deadlines related to the Benchmark."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defines what constitutes a business day for transactional purposes in the context of loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standard operating days when banks are open for transactions, affecting loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The NYFRB shall publish the overnight bank funding rate on the next succeeding Business Day."&lt;SEP&gt;"The definition of a day during which normal banking procedures can be conducted, used in the context of currency exchange."&lt;SEP&gt;"The first business day after the date the Company receives notice is significant for determining benchmarks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4cb7318cc36cb4d5ea457c2722c50d4571a9695e528ac28a501d14f808c0ef1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f39409ba6af7be45cd3c173570b9a98e697daf7a50e484fb20109ec77dceb60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1802684c18fb32d6b6b57dfc8ae152b1f62a6d7e7db1fb9e15d0b2ec9c21a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e31400f903fff2f32b0dd2b881155af0546c26f3e025fb7e6299c51e9e9e0922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f901a85d933dee59c32c998d5ea513737e15aac20ae73ca0247bde1f35d2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df08587cd1d0a8a19d20b99fcff497b3efe22a9f0038de0d25d64bca428204c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d1cd827703234a2685500f06b6795ba08ba1e0c3e897b909538e908d29dd150</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
