<node id="&quot;SAME DAY FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL INSTRUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Describes the type of funds required for immediate disbursements and payments in various currencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"Same Day Funds are the financial arrangements that require Lenders to make their loan amounts available on the same business day."&lt;SEP&gt;"Same Day Funds refer to the method of payment where amounts are to be settled on the same day the transaction occurs, ensuring prompt financial exchanges between parties."</data>
