  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Severability is a provision stating that if any part of the Loan Document is deemed illegal or unenforceable, the remaining provisions still apply."&lt;SEP&gt;"States that if any provision of the agreement is found to be invalid, the remaining provisions will remain in effect."</data>
