<node id="&quot;RECIPIENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A party legally bound to fulfill obligations under a contract, specified in relation to tax refunds paid to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity mentioned in relation to receiving and managing matters concerning the Borrower, especially in the context of tax refunds and indemnification responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity receiving payments or holding obligations under a Loan Document, subject to associated taxes and financial responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity who receives payments or benefits under the agreements and loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Denotes the Administrative Agent, any Lender, or any other recipient of payments made by or on account of any obligation of any Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The party entitled to receive the full payment amount after deductions for any required taxes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671f3b38bd6c6bb7fc6cb71e54f93c1747efdf0e7d1d512d7b432bf2cb859443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5d78065cc3e41a4cd16e57e1ecf2b9dd7b8c5201ec5228cb8a44ad16102890&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
