<node id="&quot;US DOLLARS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The currency mentioned in the context of loans, specifying the denomination of certain loans and conversions."&lt;SEP&gt;"US Dollars are the currency in which the Borrowers must make payments for Loans as stipulated in the agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"US Dollars is a specific currency denomination used for some of the Loans provided to the Borrower."</data>
