  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A law that provides a legal framework against bribery and corruption in UK commerce, which the Borrower must adhere to."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintain policies and procedures reasonably designed to promote and achieve compliance by the Company... with the UK Bribery Act 2010."</data>
