  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each Borrower is duly organized or formed, validly existing and, as applicable, in good standing under the Laws of the jurisdiction of its incorporation or organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specifies the jurisdiction that has authority over legal disputes arising from the agreement."</data>
