</node>
<node id="&quot;FATCA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sections of the Internal Revenue Code governing Foreign Account Tax Compliance, affecting the obligations of lenders and borrowers in cross-border financing arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act, under which certain taxes and regulations are imposed regarding financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Foreign Account Tax Compliance Act, which imposes reporting requirements on Foreign Lenders regarding U.S. tax compliance."</data>
