</node>
<node id="&quot;OUTSTANDING AMOUNT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Outstanding Amount indicates the unpaid balance of all Loans owed by the Borrowers, which must be monitored in compliance with the Aggregate Commitments and Sublimits."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount that remains unpaid under the loans that have been issued."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount yet to be paid under any loan agreement, representing the lender's exposure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2997033e9e9586a5d8ae522596b79da333d35edef15546a52e86c722b6d5025e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a</data>
