<node id="&quot;SETOFF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A right exercised by the Defaulting Lender to offset amounts owed with deposits held."&lt;SEP&gt;"Setoff refers to the right of lenders to apply deposits to outstanding loan obligations if an Event of Default occurs."</data>
