  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A U.S. law aimed at prohibiting corrupt practices involving overseas business transactions applicable to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintain policies and procedures reasonably designed to promote and achieve compliance by the Company... with the United States Foreign Corrupt Practices Act of 1977."</data>
