<node id="&quot;AUTHORIZED SIGNATORY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"As the authorized signatory, Nicholas Heslip represents Amazon.com, Inc. and is thus the entity legally bound to any obligations under the revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The title held by Dan Starr, indicating his official capacity to bind Goldman Sachs Bank USA to the contract terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The title held by Michael King as he signs the agreement, indicating his legal authority to bind the institutions to the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The title of Authorized Signatory is held by Kristen Posluszny, granting her authority to bind Amazon.com, Inc. in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b6bb2f73ec8bb80f8bef7c3d8b584d4d3e2d883de63fc31d3c01c75e62d1ca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27d55a9d1b3a3eba3e5b55108c18cc232e505340d34212f0094c6832be84d4dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23149313e7a61275777e51d20eb347630f9d42cd5842c8c36acbe20805076817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ee06cf91e33fee41c9599d67414d8c9424c943cafc1d99ea76d0e5fd4a8ee2</data>
