<node id="&quot;TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All present or future financial charges imposed by government authorities, including various forms of taxes and penalties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens for Taxes not yet delinquent or which are being contested in good faith and by appropriate proceedings diligently conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Mandatory payments imposed by governmental bodies that may affect financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligation related to payments that should be made free of any tax deductions according to laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations of the Company to pay and discharge all taxes that, if unpaid, could lead to a material adverse effect on its operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Various forms of taxation that can be imposed on financial transactions and entities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ea7e8a5a28315835fba0e3fc5139571e7a9e5f6def4698979811859bc6b4d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671f3b38bd6c6bb7fc6cb71e54f93c1747efdf0e7d1d512d7b432bf2cb859443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd</data>
