<node id="&quot;NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document that represents a borrower's promise to repay the loan to the lender, which must be executed by the borrower to the assignee lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"A promissory note made by a Borrower in favor of a Lender evidencing Loans made by such Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Form of B Note, a financial document that evidences the borrower's obligation to repay the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Note is a written acknowledgment executed by the Borrowers confirming their obligation to repay the Loans to the Lenders as documented in the accounts or records."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rights under the Agreement may include provisions related to the Note issued by the Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b237e48a0937e8fa5dd5ed0be7a60ecb4d190410542ba13bd092067b7bd872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5837b4e906ab93df88dde035c5e968021e4b88da4155614ac6fd5c04dd10bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1802684c18fb32d6b6b57dfc8ae152b1f62a6d7e7db1fb9e15d0b2ec9c21a9c</data>
