  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A term referring to both the Existing 3-Year Credit Agreement and the Existing 364-Day Credit Agreement collectively."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prior agreements that outline the Company's previous credit arrangements that must be settled before new commitments are effective."&lt;SEP&gt;"Use the proceeds of each Loan solely (a) to refinance borrowings, if any, under the Existing Credit Agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4d78b8bbad58fd25830c4351e9ff4ab12c8a6e8d2f092a5b63c44ff8e0a9087</data>
