</node>
<node id="&quot;MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Availability Period means the period from and including the Closing Date to the earliest of (a) the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower shall repay to the Lenders on the Maturity Date the aggregate principal amount of Loans made to such Borrower and outstanding on the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maturity Date marks the final due date for repayment of any loans under the agreement, beyond which obligations must be settled."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date specified as the due date for repayment of loans as described in the provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date when the loan is due for repayment, which may be extended through the procedures described in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The final due date for repayment of a loan as referenced in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The final due date for repayment of a loan as specified in Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The later of (a) November 1, 2028 and (b) if maturity is extended, such extended maturity date as per Section 2.12."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2997033e9e9586a5d8ae522596b79da333d35edef15546a52e86c722b6d5025e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3587aca38cbbccd56f1fd8186430321564433bb032d54890f0c181d19e314d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f43a1e5feb93c9a13d89bc1645dfacba10fe32c9b7c14fc47e0cf9c3ebd480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76b0dcaa5923e8a3efe5b7dd60fdd987169ebc30843d762c43968ce1c266567d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
