<node id="&quot;AMAZON.COM, INC.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CORPORATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Delaware corporation, referred to as the Company, participating in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A corporation that is the borrower under the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal business entity that is a party to the credit agreement, likely receiving financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal business entity that is a party to the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal business entity that is entering into a credit agreement for financial arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"AMAZON.COM, INC. is a legal business entity involved in a five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. is a corporation that is a party to the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. is a legal business entity involved in a five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. is involved in a five-year revolving credit agreement as a primary entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. is involved in the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement indicates that Amazon.com, Inc. is the principal borrower under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement involves AMAZON.COM, INC. as a significant borrowing entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement involves AMAZON.COM, INC. as the principal entity borrowing under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement of Amazon.com, Inc. indicates a borrowing entity engaged in a credit agreement to receive financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement pertains to AMAZON.COM, INC., a major corporation involved in e-commerce and various technological services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The corporation named Amazon.com, Inc. is the primary party involved in the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The designated borrower party to the revolving credit agreement, involved in the credit transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity named Amazon.com, Inc. is the party involved in the five-year revolving credit agreement, indicating it is the borrower in the context of the arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that is the borrower in a five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The five-year revolving credit agreement involving Amazon.com, Inc. as a borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The five-year revolving credit agreement of AMAZON.COM, INC. serves as a legal contract defining the terms of the loan arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal business entity that is a part of the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The legal entity that is party to the five-year revolving credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed2f3a42b192f01bd28081a0632d42d57d7e934196ff7035d9d4662789e4d97f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da6c92de5d9ba0119d12beab582743a1ee5b14977536d24575bce5019ced931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1dee774d27c3a7401264c8d35a65e469ac71db3fa8f18c2ac54b3f69d601f5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab54d282afa20f44f00b37cd84f11005cd3fdccc4b3be509b64ac7c55cc6a205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716442a7518cee46449bd436f7a39dee8c3f8cd7fc140d8d453fbaf3585ecf2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaa7077c66782daef681356b6e76dae16df17215fc1d1321a33b3ecdffbef312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d163b342a2ef1c46e4451c99c402b6fb2446cd839b2629e96f9abedd8de95524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae0879d7b3263c1ac3b35db4ae4d3bcfbd3827378d68ac22da3f42dfcc57ab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3186497d03f3092b42183853ddc9b9f03466d36a63153a16631500122b8f7ba3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ee06cf91e33fee41c9599d67414d8c9424c943cafc1d99ea76d0e5fd4a8ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7515b4c0ad76dd3f8bf557ca70e9e06f5cd3ef28c2d1c0ad18c9c80d699a5c9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6bb2f73ec8bb80f8bef7c3d8b584d4d3e2d883de63fc31d3c01c75e62d1ca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23149313e7a61275777e51d20eb347630f9d42cd5842c8c36acbe20805076817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be7021b4ee89d643b02a66b8a79b16c3ace311da7821fa4678ae9c17fc6d6da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27d55a9d1b3a3eba3e5b55108c18cc232e505340d34212f0094c6832be84d4dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9c433d0b0ff6599fa58c46db2f520a0e1d23e31ea0008c6bf488a82fb27e874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ae11622a66599a56ed298563b3402533cf258af5e7c68ee3a67ab2e86f5d97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a919fd00d1e4399f1f79049b9dd473ea6388e4ef1b6e1456c32a322d0ba65e59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-417eddcd0bab337766c282a68bfd9bea2d8a4343e248436f5d44e16731bcff52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a419e80ffb5d939da637620f47c7040f9cc417bded03017a2d6de93d71b69fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c6c700185acf568ebaf584ceb4698f6f45e5eefd00c2cbfb234890fc302271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f40c94d4d2c8c35be9dad30bb7b9888147e6ad443dea489d08dbdf1c2e5975c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f4e9c5db993c4b6bfb729b65d5bd379d56d03c160564e9cc336a74080157ce1</data>
