<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The cost of borrowing expressed as a percentage applied to the outstanding loan balance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate on a Loan may be derived from an interest rate benchmark that could be subject to regulatory reform."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3587aca38cbbccd56f1fd8186430321564433bb032d54890f0c181d19e314d2</data>
