</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender's obligation to provide financing, specifying the terms under which loans may be made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments refer to the binding obligations associated with the loans mentioned in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments refer to the obligations of Lenders to provide financing as outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 2.01 describes the commitments that lenders are obliged to provide under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments denote the lender's obligation to provide financing as per the terms of the Agreement, including the fiduciary responsibilities outlined."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments must be terminated for the Company to exercise any right of subrogation or similar rights under this Guaranty."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitments refer to the Lenders' obligations to provide financing under the terms outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations by Lenders to provide loans or lines of credit to the Borrower as per the conditions of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of Lenders to provide funding for Loans in accordance with the terms specified in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c26e344604cf7726d7004ea668272ac6ce202e8a6390a06a6db514777f3cf2f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34479c10f6712b1e76064f05ce54642ca47d753815bd4dfa5c5d91a4cca007f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0b237e48a0937e8fa5dd5ed0be7a60ecb4d190410542ba13bd092067b7bd872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdbf22f96df5a5b375f04f9532b972cb42e1e0c3f7dcfca4233a75700105788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aede7dd5a4f11c6459a462ea51adedbb28d43840ff8a22ee51d31f450a4fd5e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
