<node id="&quot;BENEFICIAL OWNERSHIP REGULATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the regulations specified in 31 C.F.R. § 1010.230 pertaining to beneficial ownership."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulation requiring Lenders to obtain and verify information on Borrowers' ownership structures for compliance with anti-money laundering rules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e31400f903fff2f32b0dd2b881155af0546c26f3e025fb7e6299c51e9e9e0922</data>
