</node>
<node id="&quot;FEE LETTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A document detailing fees related to the loan, which can be amended without needing consent from other parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific letter agreement between the Company and Citigroup Global Markets Inc. dated September 19, 2023, regarding fees associated with the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Fee Letter outlines the specific fees payable by the Company to the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4d78b8bbad58fd25830c4351e9ff4ab12c8a6e8d2f092a5b63c44ff8e0a9087</data>
