</node>
<node id="&quot;FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fees are amounts payable to the Administrative Agent and Lenders as part of the Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fees encompass various payments related to the management and structuring of the Loans, including commitment fees, arrangement fees, and others."&lt;SEP&gt;"Monetary amounts that the Company is required to pay to the Arranger, Administrative Agent, and Lenders prior to the Closing Date as part of the agreement obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Various charges associated with the loan, including administrative and processing fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Various fees mentioned in the Agreement that are impacted by whether a Lender is categorized as Defaulting or not."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdbf22f96df5a5b375f04f9532b972cb42e1e0c3f7dcfca4233a75700105788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3587aca38cbbccd56f1fd8186430321564433bb032d54890f0c181d19e314d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SONIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate per annum equal to the Sterling Overnight Index Average for any Business Day published by the SONIA Administrator."&lt;SEP&gt;"SONIA Loans refer to the loans whose interest rate is determined based on the SONIA benchmark."&lt;SEP&gt;"each SONIA Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount from the applicable borrowing date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e564967161c4b81546b1fdd8e98ad75aed3fc50da1c03eff81ad4a29f868e758</data>
