</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERNIGHT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Overnight Rate is the applicable interest rate that a Lender charges for overnight loans, influencing the costs of borrowing for Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The applicable interest rate that lenders charge on funds that are borrowed overnight."&lt;SEP&gt;"The applicable rate used for calculating interest on repayments or recoveries related to the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f39409ba6af7be45cd3c173570b9a98e697daf7a50e484fb20109ec77dceb60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6f43a6d4ee0d99d1e7746605fb912e7d6fdf643b668f276bcde7c20606febb2</data>
