</node>
<node id="&quot;EVIDENCE OF DEBT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Documentation that serves as proof of the amounts owed under the loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3587aca38cbbccd56f1fd8186430321564433bb032d54890f0c181d19e314d2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SCHEDULES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A section outlining various commitments, liens, and other administrative details pertaining to the agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a0b237e48a0937e8fa5dd5ed0be7a60ecb4d190410542ba13bd092067b7bd872</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined term indicating the entities that receive loans under the terms outlined in the preamble of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities receiving loans under the agreement that must provide verification information to the Administrative Agent and Lenders under the Patriot Act."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities receiving loans under the agreement, responsible for repayment as per the loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities receiving loans under this Agreement, obligated to comply with the terms and conditions set within it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that receive loans under the agreements, bearing the obligation to repay the specified amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to entities receiving loans as per the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers are the entities receiving loans under the agreements, obligated to make repayments to the Lenders through the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers are the entities receiving the loan and are responsible for repaying it according to the terms specified in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers are the parties that receive loans under the agreement and must respond to notifications from the Administrative Agent regarding outstanding amounts and commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entities receiving loans from Lenders under the conditions stipulated in the Agreement."</data>
