  <data key="d1">"A legal obligation guaranteeing the Indebtedness or other obligations of a Person, ensuring payment or performance by a primary obligor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guaranty represents a legal decision to waive certain defenses and obligations that might discharge the Company from its Guarantee Obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdd13e9cff4b44f1f996d575f0a8ec72755a2ea622bac476546165cd09900b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84af9ccbe90a9c103a2c2207e81856f09e401bfac4b87201be77e022b1fada1d</data>
