<node id="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of loan tied to a benchmark interest rate, subjected to conditions regarding legality and specific interest rate determination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans of a specific term that are tied to a Benchmark for interest rate calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans are loans that can be continued or converted on the last day of an Interest Period and are subject to the Lenders' consent during events of default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962</data>
