</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certain subsidiaries of Amazon.com, Inc. included under the term Designated Borrower within the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Companies that are wholly owned or controlled by the Company, which may also have borrowing obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities owned or controlled by the Company, relevant to the financial definitions within the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that are controlled by the Company and may be involved in the obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that are owned or controlled by the Company which are not eligible for certain assignments under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries refer to the entities wholly or partially owned by the Company, which may have their own obligations and are included in the Company's financial and operational scope."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subsidiaries are legally distinct entities under the control of the Company, affecting compliance with covenants and financial reporting."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial results of the Company include those of its Subsidiaries, as outlined in the Audited Financial Statements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Subsidiaries' refers to entities that are controlled by the Company and are included in the consolidated financial statements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-66a5b6127473a9f4242a45cf7f76da3a1c7b00048d778a02556229524f754cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-928a1ae0961152b09f4da25a11b845d54b0eee3632984d5b436203de958c27f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d3279c6cea71670b97d9c418ae00decf29b16ec16ad6c963df50ed02d5c434b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce8b2ab918bc2ac2fae1fd5cbd9e379e3b29035370465def38ddf18fc7e593eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed45c6c96103ab059aceb21c9095ebdb108ab095fa5004a7e6ef0bf873513bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASE RATE LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A category of loans where interest rates are determined based on a specified base rate, susceptible to adjustments regarding legality."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan that uses a base rate as a reference for setting the interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate Loans are a category of loans where the interest is based on a reference rate, specifically the Prime Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans denominated in US Dollars that are based on a reference interest rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indebtedness of any Person shall include the Indebtedness of any partnership or joint venture in which such Person is a general partner or a joint venturer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness refers to the financial obligations of the Company and its Subsidiaries, including loans and leases secured by Liens against assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness refers to the obligations of the Company and its Subsidiaries, particularly regarding the principal amount outstanding under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens securing any Indebtedness having (individually or together with related items of Indebtedness so secured) a principal amount greater than US$250,000,000."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations or debts that are secured by liens against the Company's assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations or debts incurred by the Company or its Subsidiaries, often related to financing and security interests in assets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total obligations of a Person for borrowed money, including various financial instruments and obligations related to credit."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-66a5b6127473a9f4242a45cf7f76da3a1c7b00048d778a02556229524f754cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55848c3f3528776bc10163e1eae281a9a0245264a349b24750774dd15c19274c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5d78065cc3e41a4cd16e57e1ecf2b9dd7b8c5201ec5228cb8a44ad16102890&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84af9ccbe90a9c103a2c2207e81856f09e401bfac4b87201be77e022b1fada1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
