<node id="&quot;NEW YORK BRANCH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BRANCH"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New York Branch of Banco Santander, S.A. responsible for facilitating the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a919fd00d1e4399f1f79049b9dd473ea6388e4ef1b6e1456c32a322d0ba65e59</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CITIBANK, N.A.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial institution serving as the Administrative Agent in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"CITIBANK, N.A. is a financial institution providing loans and serving as the Administrative Agent for the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each of the Lenders hereby irrevocably appoints Citibank, N.A. to act as the Administrative Agent hereunder and under the other Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Serves as the administrative agent, sole lead arranger, and syndication agent for the lending group in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-417eddcd0bab337766c282a68bfd9bea2d8a4343e248436f5d44e16731bcff52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f40c94d4d2c8c35be9dad30bb7b9888147e6ad443dea489d08dbdf1c2e5975c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTENCE, QUALIFICATION AND POWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REPRESENTATIONS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The legal standing and authority of the parties to enter into the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d3587aca38cbbccd56f1fd8186430321564433bb032d54890f0c181d19e314d2</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGGREGATE COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Aggregate Commitments are the total obligations of the Lender to provide financing under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aggregate Commitments refer to the total amount of borrowings that the Borrowers can utilize under the terms set out in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aggregate Commitments reflect the total amount available for borrowing by the Company, against which fees are calculated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Aggregate Commitments represent the total financial obligations undertaken by the Lenders in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An amount that determines the total financial obligations or credit limits available in the lending agreement, specifically referencing the Alternative Currency Sublimit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total commitments of all lenders at any time, specified as US$15,000,000,000 as of the Closing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"the date of termination of the Aggregate Commitments pursuant to Section 2.04 or 8.02."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2997033e9e9586a5d8ae522596b79da333d35edef15546a52e86c722b6d5025e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-040bab39da9786ff0f3cafd4425e251c09564b0124c1823abcad4bb4a496cb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EURIBO RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A European reference rate used for short-term loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"EURIBO Rate is another benchmark rate applicable to Term Benchmark Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate at which European banks lend to each other, used as a Benchmark for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"With respect to any Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in Euro for any Interest Period, the EURIBO Screen Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Euro, the EURIBO Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d506667a8395aa3be8c9d19bd89c9e9e050e1c599089f07ada478b9b6ee4079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40</data>
