<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific type of Subsidiary recognized in the agreement as a borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Applicant Borrower becomes a Designated Borrower once approved by the Administrative Agent and the Lenders, allowing it to receive Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"An identified Borrower that may be a foreign subsidiary or otherwise specified under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each designated borrower is a subsidiary of Amazon.com, Inc., included in the credit agreement as a party to the borrowing terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specifically identified entities within the Agreement that may borrow funds under certain outlined conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company acknowledges that it is solely responsible for obtaining financial information from each Designated Borrower, having no reliance on the Credit Parties for such disclosures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower is a specific entity identified to receive the loan under the agreement and specified in the preamble."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower is an entity that may borrow from the lenders under the specified agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower is the entity that receives loans and is responsible for making payments to the Lender as specified in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower refers to the entity receiving the loan and is acknowledged in this agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The applicable Designated Borrower may compensate the Lender as per the terms established in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific borrower that is a foreign subsidiary and is associated with the restrictions of immunity from jurisdiction."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93274523ea8cfdffe9cb49b239093b9b8fd8cc1fcabcf6c7085087dd7bd81fff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-928a1ae0961152b09f4da25a11b845d54b0eee3632984d5b436203de958c27f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de89031fb05d6268cdaade8e6f8ee037aff51ae412cca50ea016ef150ccff1b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ec9803c3d1ce225d3e17de0425af729d3c187fa1fb248af233dda60e473eeab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-520efb27c71261258643d7e53341822e6e3ec69de9e97532a2b9bb4fc458a6c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e50be65db4b6ac7ec46a8f1cad6186244bcd63f2e5df406958ff61986d1b2af4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TIBO RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific interest rate benchmark typically used in the context of loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"TIBO Rate is a benchmark used for certain Term Benchmark Loans provided to borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"TIBO Rate is an interest rate benchmark for borrowings denominated in Yen, utilized to set loan interest rates in financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate at which Japanese banks lend to each other, applicable in specific loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Yen, the TIBO Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40</data>
