<node id="&quot;SWAP CONTRACTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contracts entered into to manage risks in the ordinary course of business, which may also have associated liens."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal contracts under which financial swaps are executed, with the ability to close out based on certain conditions."</data>
