<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amounts the Borrower owes to the Lenders, including principal, interest, fees, and other charges."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial responsibilities of the Borrower under the Agreement and Loan Documents that must be fulfilled."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal duties that survive termination, replacement, or assignment within the context of the credit agreement obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to all financial commitments associated with the loan that must be fulfilled by the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the Borrowers' responsibilities for repayment and adherence to the terms outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the financial responsibilities each party has under the terms of this Agreement and associated Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations are the responsibilities and debts that the designated Borrowers must fulfill."&lt;SEP&gt;"The debts or responsibilities owed by the Defaulting Lender that may be subject to setoff rights by it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial responsibilities and liabilities that are due, particularly those owed to the Lenders under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial responsibilities of the Borrower as stipulated in the Agreement that are to be fulfilled regardless of any potential recoveries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations under the Guaranty are related to all amounts payable under this Guaranty which includes payments for indemnification and expense reimbursement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a3a25d833dc5c9dbf51acf95e17a8c4594980b2f8443c4b8cd76209f44fc05e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-845ee0ce7846a3a47b3352decf9999b720680fae98253ee1de3b3cf5834eb0ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70b37914c7be727f7cf3b7debe72de6fc09c9ea0cb16e42c919b83d6539e6663&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-040bab39da9786ff0f3cafd4425e251c09564b0124c1823abcad4bb4a496cb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e50be65db4b6ac7ec46a8f1cad6186244bcd63f2e5df406958ff61986d1b2af4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
