<node id="&quot;AUD BANK BILL RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"AUD Bank Bill Rate is used for funding Term Benchmark Loans in AUD."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Australian interest rate benchmark used for short-term borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"An interest rate used for determining the rate on ABBR Loans in the context of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The benchmark interest rate for loans that are based on Australian bank bills."&lt;SEP&gt;"means a rate relating to Term Benchmark Borrowing in Australian Dollars for any Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Australian Dollars, the AUD Bank Bill Rate."</data>
