<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFIED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indemnified Taxes are additional amounts the Borrower may need to pay to the Lender or Governmental Authority regarding the loan obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes for which additional amounts have been paid and are due, referenced in the context of responsibility and contesting obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes for which the Borrower must increase payment amounts to ensure the Recipient receives the correct amount after withholding."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes for which the Borrower must provide indemnity payments, referenced in the context of tax refunds and liability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are imposed on any payment made under the obligations of any Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are to be compensated by a Borrower to a Lender or Governmental Authority as specified in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671f3b38bd6c6bb7fc6cb71e54f93c1747efdf0e7d1d512d7b432bf2cb859443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
