</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A borrowing arrangement linked to the Term Secured Overnight Financing Rate, used as a benchmark for interest calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR Borrowing is a type of borrowing that is based on the Term SOFR loans, indicating the nature of loans derived from this benchmark."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831</data>
