<node id="&quot;RESIGNATION EFFECTIVE DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Resignation Effective Date marks the date from which the retiring or removed Administrative Agent is discharged from duties and obligations under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which any resignation notice by the Administrative Agent becomes effective, leading to potential appointment of a successor."</data>
