<node id="&quot;INVESTMENT COMPANY ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulations concerning investment companies that must be adhered to within the context of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Investment Company Act of 1940 is referenced concerning the eligibility and registration status of the Company and the Borrowers."</data>
