<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Collective term for documents relating to the loans, governed by the primary Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents associated with the loan agreement that have legal effects akin to an original paper agreement, including as related to electronic signatures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents that outline the rights, responsibilities, and obligations of all parties involved in the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal contracts and agreements that govern the actions and obligations of the Borrower, Lenders, and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal documents that encompass all agreements related to the loan, including the terms and conditions of the loan, and the implications of the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents include all agreements and records related to the Loans, detailing terms, obligations, and related fees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents refer to all documents related to the loans provided under this Agreement, including any amendments and modifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents refer to the legal contracts that outline the terms and conditions of the loans provided to the Company, including the roles of the Administrative Agent, Lenders, and other parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents to which each Borrower is a party outline the obligations and terms under which the Borrower operates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The set of documents including Agreement, Notes, Borrower Requests, Notices, and Fee Letters that govern the loan transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"The set of documents that define the obligations and rights in relation to the loans and the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"related Loan Documents refer to the legal documents connected to the Agreement that govern the terms of loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f50b17bab75f31965c93c4d7bd2f14b658481cc3c8810926c4014b58d70bda0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64237ca7ee70ecd83f0946b9540617351d1643eee21284e4825864ab52ed6728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e31400f903fff2f32b0dd2b881155af0546c26f3e025fb7e6299c51e9e9e0922&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed45c6c96103ab059aceb21c9095ebdb108ab095fa5004a7e6ef0bf873513bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f901a85d933dee59c32c998d5ea513737e15aac20ae73ca0247bde1f35d2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f43a1e5feb93c9a13d89bc1645dfacba10fe32c9b7c14fc47e0cf9c3ebd480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041</data>
