  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial entity included in the lending group for the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Royal Bank of Canada serves as the lender in the revolving credit agreement, providing the financing needed by Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
