<node id="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Permitted Holder means, as of any date of determination, the person who is the Company’s Executive Chair on the Closing Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Closing Date marks the execution of the Agreement and is pivotal in determining when the loan becomes effective."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Date when the loan transaction is officially closed and the Availability Period begins."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date by which certain obligations, payments, and conditions must be fulfilled under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date specified as the beginning of the obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The first date when all conditions precedent in Section 4.01 are satisfied or waived, marking a significant milestone in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date by which certain documentation must be delivered to comply with tax obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific date on which the loan agreement becomes effective and is signed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4cb7318cc36cb4d5ea457c2722c50d4571a9695e528ac28a501d14f808c0ef1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef6c7eda3071071cce06d8e7b726e368033b7ce81b07f5413f242a12d56ea76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85ef6ac5a1c6b87ea330f630646059e0bb68c988df4982313a1ca1446ecc64c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e19eeb4d91d88a819da58ff7f22334afcbd8b4e79c861858ec896b44ba553485&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041</data>
