</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE OF CONTROL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A situation where the ownership or control of the Company changes, which may have implications on financial agreements and commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event where a person or group gains beneficial ownership of 50% or more of the equity securities of the Company, impacting governance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cef6c7eda3071071cce06d8e7b726e368033b7ce81b07f5413f242a12d56ea76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb</data>
