</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM CORRA TRANSITION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A significant occurrence that triggers the need to modify the current benchmark for a loan in response to market changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event that affects the availability or structure of a specific term CORRA benchmark, potentially requiring a change in the reference rate used in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event triggering the need for changes in the benchmark due to the transition from the current rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522</data>
