<node id="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A borrowing arrangement that is structured based on benchmark interest rates, specifically in Canadian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to various borrowing types linked to benchmark interest rates such as Term SOFR, CDOR, and others used in structured credit arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"refers to borrowings that are tied to specific benchmark interest rates, such as Term SOFR."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef6c7eda3071071cce06d8e7b726e368033b7ce81b07f5413f242a12d56ea76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial agreement under which a lender provides funds to a borrower, with terms including interest rates and repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"A financial arrangement provided under the Loan Document facilitating the borrowing of funds by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"A general term referring to the various structured credit arrangements provided to the Borrower, including Term Benchmark Loans and RFR Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal contract outlining the terms, obligations, and conditions under which the Borrower receives financing."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured credit arrangement provided by the Lenders to the Borrower, detailing specific terms and repayment conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured credit arrangement where the Lender agrees to make funds available to the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans are financial arrangements that the Borrower can request in different currencies, including US Dollars and Alternative Currencies."&lt;SEP&gt;"So long as any Lender shall have any Commitment hereunder, or any Loan or other Obligation hereunder shall remain unpaid or unsatisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money provided to the Borrower under the terms defined in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial amount provided by the Lender under the terms specified in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The money borrowed by the Borrowers under the terms of the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-147a7244e05e5e0a792e28cc6e5a66776b68530e7b78e657803cca8165c2a30c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-928a1ae0961152b09f4da25a11b845d54b0eee3632984d5b436203de958c27f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662d9179320cf820c5a366528a40024cf7419d4e2a73a789f30004737c357c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce8b2ab918bc2ac2fae1fd5cbd9e379e3b29035370465def38ddf18fc7e593eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f43a1e5feb93c9a13d89bc1645dfacba10fe32c9b7c14fc47e0cf9c3ebd480</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan that references the Term Secured Overnight Financing Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR Loan is a loan that bears interest at a rate based primarily on the Term SOFR, emphasizing the loan's connection to this benchmark."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
