<node id="&quot;PTE 84-14&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PTE 84-14 is a class exemption related to certain transactions that applies to Lenders, ensuring compliance with ERISA regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34479c10f6712b1e76064f05ce54642ca47d753815bd4dfa5c5d91a4cca007f7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JOYCE P. DORSETT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Joyce P. Dorsett is the Senior Vice President at U.S. Bank National Association, responsible for executing the lending agreement with Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d163b342a2ef1c46e4451c99c402b6fb2446cd839b2629e96f9abedd8de95524</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An authority involved in regulating and overseeing aspects of financial transactions, including those related to Liens and asset acquisition."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity or institution that has the authority to enforce laws and regulations affecting the lender's ability to operate."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity or organization that exercises authority or control over a governmental function."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any official body responsible for governance and regulation, which may influence the terms of the Agreement through legal or regulatory changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defined as the entity exercising various governmental powers, including executive, legislative, and judicial functions in the United States or any other nation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authority is mentioned as a party involved in potential legal actions or compliance issues faced by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authority refers to the entities responsible for enforcing regulations and overseeing the adherence to the legal obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"No approval, consent, exemption, authorization, or other action by any Governmental Authority is required for the Borrower's execution of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity responsible for receiving tax payments and ensuring compliance with federal and other applicable laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef6c7eda3071071cce06d8e7b726e368033b7ce81b07f5413f242a12d56ea76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671f3b38bd6c6bb7fc6cb71e54f93c1747efdf0e7d1d512d7b432bf2cb859443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5d78065cc3e41a4cd16e57e1ecf2b9dd7b8c5201ec5228cb8a44ad16102890&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed45c6c96103ab059aceb21c9095ebdb108ab095fa5004a7e6ef0bf873513bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aede7dd5a4f11c6459a462ea51adedbb28d43840ff8a22ee51d31f450a4fd5e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84af9ccbe90a9c103a2c2207e81856f09e401bfac4b87201be77e022b1fada1d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
