  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan that bears interest at a rate based on the TIBO Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PORTFOLIO INTEREST EXEMPTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific U.S. tax exemption for interest paid to non-U.S. investors, which must be certified to the IRS."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71926bba5cc37a2755872e00f76b4d781b7e713080d4f728381fb8c26ebe6239</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECURITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COLLATERAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Security constitutes collateral pledged to secure the obligations under the Guaranty, providing assurance to the Credit Parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdd13e9cff4b44f1f996d575f0a8ec72755a2ea622bac476546165cd09900b02</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL ASSETS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Total assets of at least US$50 million are stated as a criterion for the independence of the person making investment decisions for the Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-34479c10f6712b1e76064f05ce54642ca47d753815bd4dfa5c5d91a4cca007f7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal claims against assets of the Company or its Subsidiaries to secure the obligation for repayment of duties, debts, or contractual obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal rights or interests a lender has in the borrower's property, existing to secure the repayment of a loan, particularly in relation to the Company or a Subsidiary."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liens are legal rights or claims against assets that are granted to secure a loan or transaction, ensuring the lender has a claim to the borrower's assets in the event of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Restriction on the creation of liens that could affect the lenders' interests."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5d78065cc3e41a4cd16e57e1ecf2b9dd7b8c5201ec5228cb8a44ad16102890&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55848c3f3528776bc10163e1eae281a9a0245264a349b24750774dd15c19274c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66a5b6127473a9f4242a45cf7f76da3a1c7b00048d778a02556229524f754cc7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE PERCENTAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A percentage that determines the share of loans that each lender is entitled to based on their agreement and participation in the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Applicable Percentage describes the ratio determining how unpaid amounts are allocated among Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Applicable Percentage is the share or portion of the payment that each Lender receives from the total payment made by the Borrowers as distributed by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"the percentage of the Aggregate Commitments represented by a Lender’s Commitment at any time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a1802684c18fb32d6b6b57dfc8ae152b1f62a6d7e7db1fb9e15d0b2ec9c21a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-040bab39da9786ff0f3cafd4425e251c09564b0124c1823abcad4bb4a496cb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CME GROUP BENCHMARK ADMINISTRATION LIMITED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Administrator of the forward looking term Secured Overnight Financing Rate (SOFR)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Subsidiary is a company that is completely or partly owned by another company and is relevant in the context of indemnities."&lt;SEP&gt;"A corporation, partnership, joint venture, limited liability company or other business entity that is controlled by a Person or entity, typically owned by a majority of shares."&lt;SEP&gt;"A subsidiary entity of the Company, involved in securing intercompany indebtedness and other obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Subsidiary that is a Designated Borrower or a significant subsidiary of the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Subsidiary of the Company can be designated as a Designated Borrower and is part of the obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity related to the Company that must preserve and maintain its corporate existence and the rights, licenses, and permits material to its business conduct."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintain policies and procedures reasonably designed to promote and achieve compliance by the Company, its Subsidiaries, its and their respective directors, officers and employees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries of the Borrowers are mentioned in the context of their compliance with laws and any material adverse effects stemming from litigation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-55848c3f3528776bc10163e1eae281a9a0245264a349b24750774dd15c19274c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ea7e8a5a28315835fba0e3fc5139571e7a9e5f6def4698979811859bc6b4d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e564967161c4b81546b1fdd8e98ad75aed3fc50da1c03eff81ad4a29f868e758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aede7dd5a4f11c6459a462ea51adedbb28d43840ff8a22ee51d31f450a4fd5e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e50be65db4b6ac7ec46a8f1cad6186244bcd63f2e5df406958ff61986d1b2af4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278f6ba92cd0eaf239dad46b207ebf3b76fc7320e864c3ab7403f1d6bd69eb5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL CREDIT EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The unused Commitment and the Revolving Credit Exposure of any Lender at any time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the laws in effect, including FATCA, that govern the obligations and indemnifications outlined in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TRUSTEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity appointed to manage the repayment or obligations in the event of insolvency under Debtor Relief Law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Trustee is a party that may be involved in proceedings where payments made under the Guaranty can be declared invalid or preferential."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STRUCTURING FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Structuring Fees are payments received for the arrangement and management of the financing transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FUNDAMENTAL CHANGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NEGATIVE COVENANT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provision that limits changes in the fundamental structure or operations of the company."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of currency other than the primary currency used in the lending agreement, relevant to the lender's market operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alternative Currency is defined as any lawful currency that is available and can be converted into US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alternative Currency refers to any currency other than US Dollars that may be used for loan repayment under specific conditions outlined in the agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alternative Currency refers to any other currency used in loan transactions apart from US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any currency other than the US Dollar used in borrowing transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any currency other than the US Dollar."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any currency other than the primary currency used in loan agreements, often specified in loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Currencies other than the base currency used in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Currency other than the standard currency used for making loans and payments under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Includes Euro, Sterling, Yen, Canadian Dollars, Australian Dollars, Swiss Francs, and any other currency (other than US Dollars) approved under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Overnight Rate is determined for any amount denominated in any Alternative Currency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4cb7318cc36cb4d5ea457c2722c50d4571a9695e528ac28a501d14f808c0ef1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1802684c18fb32d6b6b57dfc8ae152b1f62a6d7e7db1fb9e15d0b2ec9c21a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate per annum equal to the secured overnight financing rate as administered by the SOFR Administrator."&lt;SEP&gt;"SOFR is a reference interest rate that impacts various loan agreements and their terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secured Overnight Financing Rate used as a reference for certain loans denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The forward looking term Secured Overnight Financing Rate administered by CME Group Benchmark Administration Limited."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2df08587cd1d0a8a19d20b99fcff497b3efe22a9f0038de0d25d64bca428204c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e564967161c4b81546b1fdd8e98ad75aed3fc50da1c03eff81ad4a29f868e758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-CONSENTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Non-Consenting Lender is a lender that does not agree to specific amendments or waivers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Lender that does not approve any consent, waiver or amendment requiring the approval of all affected Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL OUTSTANDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The aggregate Outstanding Amount of all Loans at any specified time."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount that is currently outstanding under the loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total Outstandings represent the total amount borrowed by the Company under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total Outstandings represent the total amount of loans that the Borrowers currently owe at any given time, which must be managed within the limits of the Aggregate Commitments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2997033e9e9586a5d8ae522596b79da333d35edef15546a52e86c722b6d5025e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER’S EXPENSE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to costs incurred by the Borrower while contesting Indemnified Taxes, highlighting the fiscal responsibilities of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RECEIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Receiver may take action in the event of claims against any payments made by the Company under the Guaranty, influencing obligations discussed therein."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Commitment Fees are charges incurred by the Lenders for agreeing to lend money under the specified terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SANCTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Covenant prohibiting actions that would violate sanctions laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal restrictions that may affect the Borrowers or their Subsidiaries, specifically concerning financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal restrictions that prohibit specific activities or transactions with certain individuals, entities, or countries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ce8b2ab918bc2ac2fae1fd5cbd9e379e3b29035370465def38ddf18fc7e593eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-928a1ae0961152b09f4da25a11b845d54b0eee3632984d5b436203de958c27f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CURRENCY SUBLIMIT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Alternative Currency Sublimit is a specific limitation regarding borrowings in alternative currencies, which is part of the overall Aggregate Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"An amount equal to the lesser of the Aggregate Commitments and US$5,000,000,000, which is part of the overall lending structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"The maximum amount of loans that can be provided in Alternative Currencies."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2997033e9e9586a5d8ae522596b79da333d35edef15546a52e86c722b6d5025e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Collective term referring to the Administrative Agent, the Lenders, and other connected parties within the agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Credit Parties include lenders entitled to enforce the Guarantee Obligations provided by the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Credit Parties are entitled to payment concerning the amounts payable under the Guaranty and hold rights related to any amounts paid to the Company in violation of its limitations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fdd13e9cff4b44f1f996d575f0a8ec72755a2ea622bac476546165cd09900b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each Lender that is not a Defaulting Lender at a given time."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ABB LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan characterized under the ABBR loan structure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT’S RIGHTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Administrative Agent's legal rights concerning necessary actions that affect the Borrower or Lender obligations under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INVALIDATED PAYMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Invalidated Payments refer to amounts that must be repaid if subsequently deemed fraudulent or preferential according to the law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARRANGEMENT FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Arrangement Fees are the costs associated with setting up and managing the financing structure for the Loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVENTS OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Specific events that may trigger a default under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICANT BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Applicant Borrower is any additional Subsidiary of the Company that may be designated to receive Loans under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that applies for borrowing under the lending agreement, as referenced in Section 2.14(a)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e50be65db4b6ac7ec46a8f1cad6186244bcd63f2e5df406958ff61986d1b2af4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNITEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Parties that are indemnified under various provisions of the agreements, grouped within Credit Parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NONDISCLOSURE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An agreement that has the meaning specified in Section 11.07."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nondisclosure Agreement is a binding contract ensuring that confidential information shared between the Company and lenders remains protected."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff5e2434da655a2671e0dad2380df7ed33831a7ffce6ba8ccd31c237a80d8f4</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UK RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GOVERNMENT AGENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Bank of England or other authority responsible for the resolution of any UK Financial Institution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM OF THE SECTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Describes the provisions covered under Section 3.01 relating to Taxes and their implications for Borrower and Recipient."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER GUARANTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Other Guarantor is any additional entity providing a guarantee for the obligations of the Designated Borrower under the Guaranty."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FACILITY FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Facility Fees are payments related to the administration of loan facilities extended to the borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REMEDIES UPON EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Outline of actions that lenders may take if a default occurs."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARRANGER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Citibank, N.A., serving as the sole lead arranger and joint bookrunner for the lending agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each of the Company and each other Borrower hereby agrees not to assert any claims against the Arranger."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arranger collaborates with the Administrative Agent and informs the Lenders regarding transactions associated with the Loans and Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arranger is an entity involved in structuring and organizing the Loans and Commitments, as well as facilitating the terms laid out in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arranger is mentioned as a party to whom Lenders make representations and warranties concerning the Loans and the Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial institution or entity responsible for arranging the particulars of the loan agreement, facilitating negotiations between parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c26e344604cf7726d7004ea668272ac6ce202e8a6390a06a6db514777f3cf2f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34479c10f6712b1e76064f05ce54642ca47d753815bd4dfa5c5d91a4cca007f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-300d7b2b96710e2ebf9fe426209554011a187cc446a1d3b492541e9331becd87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CORRA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Canadian Overnight Repo Rate Average, which is administered and published by the Bank of Canada."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term CORRA is the rate applied to outstanding principal for CORRA Borrowing, bearing interest during the Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term CORRA refers to an interest rate benchmark recommended by the Relevant Governmental Body, used for determining loans and financial agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A subsidiary of the Company that has substantial financial importance or significance to the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Subsidiary that is a Designated Borrower or a significant subsidiary of the Company as defined by SEC."&lt;SEP&gt;"Subsidiaries of the Company that are significant in terms of financial implications or obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ce8b2ab918bc2ac2fae1fd5cbd9e379e3b29035370465def38ddf18fc7e593eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A classification for entities under U.S. law, indicating specific tax obligations and documentation requirements when acting as a Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"A designation for entities classified as having a presence or legal standing in the United States, relevant in appointing a successor Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Person defined as a 'United States Person' under Section 7701(a)(30) of the Code."&lt;SEP&gt;"The U.S. Person refers to an entity that must be a U.S. citizen or resident as stipulated in the context of appointing a successor Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f50b17bab75f31965c93c4d7bd2f14b658481cc3c8810926c4014b58d70bda0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85ef6ac5a1c6b87ea330f630646059e0bb68c988df4982313a1ca1446ecc64c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-147a7244e05e5e0a792e28cc6e5a66776b68530e7b78e657803cca8165c2a30c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3.01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific section of the credit agreement outlining tax-related obligations and roles of various entities involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 3.01 addresses payments required to be made and conditions affecting them under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL CONDITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Financial Condition refers to the health and operational status of the Designated Borrower that the Company is responsible for assessing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UPFRONT FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Upfront Fees are initial payments required by the Lenders at the beginning of the loan arrangement process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICATION OF FUNDS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Guidelines for how funds should be allocated in the event of a default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPLICABLE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Determines the interest charged with varying percentages for different loan types, specifically Base Rate Loans and Term Benchmark Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate applicable to Base Rate Loans, which may vary based on creditworthiness or other factors."&lt;SEP&gt;"each Term SOFR Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof for the Interest Period at a rate equal to the Term SOFR plus the Applicable Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f77a409230252918816b5f320c9010f58a33a3992a1995a9ec71618f6028f0a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indebtedness of the Company or any Subsidiary in an aggregate outstanding principal amount of $1,500,000,000 or more, excluding certain types of obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to significant debts that the Company or any Subsidiary must pay, which if not paid on time can trigger legal consequences."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. TAX COMPLIANCE CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A certificate provided by the Foreign Lender confirming their tax status under U.S. regulatory requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A certificate specified in connection with U.S. tax compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-71926bba5cc37a2755872e00f76b4d781b7e713080d4f728381fb8c26ebe6239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The interest rate that is determined based on specific agreements among lenders, borrowers, and benchmark ratings."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indemnification refers to obligations that may arise under the Guaranty requiring the Company to cover particular expenses or claims."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNDERWRITING FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Underwriting Fees are costs associated with the evaluation and assessment of risks linked to the loan provision."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELIGIBLE ASSIGNEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ASSIGNEE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A party that is eligible to receive loan rights via assignment as per the agreement's requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Eligible Assignee is an entity that can assume the obligations of a Defaulting or Non-Extending Lender based on the terms outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Person that meets the requirements to be an assignee under Section 11.06(b)(v), subject to such consents as may be required under Section 11.06(b)(iii)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d506667a8395aa3be8c9d19bd89c9e9e050e1c599089f07ada478b9b6ee4079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. INTERNAL REVENUE CODE OF 1986&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The federal law governing the taxation in the United States, referenced in the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIGNIFICANT SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Subsidiary that meets the criteria defined by the SEC as a significant entity based on financial metrics."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITE-DOWN AND CONVERSION POWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The powers granted to regulatory authorities to reduce or convert liabilities of Affected Financial Institutions as part of financial recovery measures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The powers of an EEA Resolution Authority regarding write-down and conversion of liabilities under Bail-In Legislation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a36a51b9c6e3870c095291ddaef64f2cba729c672dfbce57a1e311105f7c0f73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK LOANS DENOMINATED IN US DOLLARS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A particular category of Term Benchmark Loans that are issued in US Dollars, subject to specific legal obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal decision to waive a contractual obligation, which must be written and signed per the terms outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A waiver is a decision by the Lender to forgo a requirement or condition stated under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TICKING FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ticking Fees refer to charges incurred during the waiting period before a loan is drawn down."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RIGHTS AS A LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Description of the fundamental rights granted to lenders under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Description of the rights held by lenders under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFILIATE OF A LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity that is related to a Lender and may be involved in assignments as per the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any entity that is administered or managed by a Lender or an entity related as an affiliate to such Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0d3279c6cea71670b97d9c418ae00decf29b16ec16ad6c963df50ed02d5c434b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0</data>
