<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal obligation by Lenders to provide financing, which may be declared terminated upon the occurrence of an Event of Default."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender's obligation to provide financing as defined within the terms of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender's obligation to provide financing which is subject to agreement stipulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"An obligation of a lender to provide a loan under the specified agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitment refers to the obligation of Non-Extending Lenders to provide financing, which terminates on the Existing Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender's obligation to provide financing to the Company under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to each Lender's commitment to make Loans to the Borrowers as specified in Section 2.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"So long as any Lender shall have any Commitment hereunder, or any Loan or other Obligation hereunder shall remain unpaid or unsatisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"The aggregate amount of the Commitment includes Loans outstanding and must meet the minimum threshold for assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial obligation or promise made by lenders to provide funds under the lending agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0d3279c6cea71670b97d9c418ae00decf29b16ec16ad6c963df50ed02d5c434b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce8b2ab918bc2ac2fae1fd5cbd9e379e3b29035370465def38ddf18fc7e593eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51f421f582f9eda4757f24834045c2a926ef032fed106ad64b520d4890cb350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044ac292813503e9cfce3ba7ba160a5f4eab71a0d366176f91b31b9f5174b5b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
