</node>
<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SARON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference rate for loans denominated in Swiss Francs."&lt;SEP&gt;"An interest rate for loans denominated in Swiss Francs, based on daily SARON rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SARON is a benchmark used for specific RFR Loans provided under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate used for loans that bear interest based on the Daily Simple SARON."&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Swiss Francs, the Daily Simple SARON."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e564967161c4b81546b1fdd8e98ad75aed3fc50da1c03eff81ad4a29f868e758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77a409230252918816b5f320c9010f58a33a3992a1995a9ec71618f6028f0a6</data>
