<node id="&quot;LIABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liabilities are defined as the financial responsibilities and legal claims against parties as stipulated in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liabilities refer to any legal and financial obligations incurred by the Indemnitees arising from the execution or delivery of this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liabilities refer to responsibilities or financial obligations that may arise during the course of the agreement or from the Borrower's actions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-040bab39da9786ff0f3cafd4425e251c09564b0124c1823abcad4bb4a496cb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9638c2b01acba8fc68afa2927208be4b033d37a2af85b73f93461098d18399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d</data>
