  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined timeframe related to interest calculation settings under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specified duration of time pertinent to the calculation of interest that does not extend beyond the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the duration over which interest is calculated for borrowings, an essential element in the structuring of loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the duration for which interest is calculated on a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period defines the duration for which the interest rate is applicable for Term Benchmark Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period refers to the duration of time in which the interest on a loan is calculated and payments are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"The defined period during which the interest rate is applicable for a Term Benchmark Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The duration for which an interest rate is applied to a loan, often specified during borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The period associated with the terms of a Term Benchmark Loan, affecting payment dates and amounts."&lt;SEP&gt;"The period for which the interest rate is applied to the borrowing, as defined in the context of Term Benchmark Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific duration for which the interest amount is calculated on the loan, influencing the terms of the borrowing agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific duration for which the interest rate is applied to the outstanding balance, crucial for calculating loan payments and adjustments related to the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific time frame during which the interest rate applies to a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified time frame during which interest is calculated and due on loans under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The time duration used for interest calculations based on the applicable Benchmark in borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"The timeframe for which the loans are structured, specifically noted as one month for the Term Benchmark Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"each Term SOFR Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof for the Interest Period applicable to such Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"referring to the period for which interest payments are calculated based on a Benchmark."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef6c7eda3071071cce06d8e7b726e368033b7ce81b07f5413f242a12d56ea76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d506667a8395aa3be8c9d19bd89c9e9e050e1c599089f07ada478b9b6ee4079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0f8ee5eda6ed64227198554e9a303a0636f90e2a487a78516e1751ee90b484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f901a85d933dee59c32c998d5ea513737e15aac20ae73ca0247bde1f35d2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df08587cd1d0a8a19d20b99fcff497b3efe22a9f0038de0d25d64bca428204c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f43a1e5feb93c9a13d89bc1645dfacba10fe32c9b7c14fc47e0cf9c3ebd480</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
