<node id="&quot;BAIL-IN ACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal decision affecting the treatment of unsecured liabilities during financial distress, allowing for liability conversions or reductions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bail-In Action refers to a scenario where a financial institution’s creditors may be required to absorb some of the losses, impacting Lenders involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"means the exercise of any Write-Down and Conversion Powers by the applicable Resolution Authority in respect of any liability of any Affected Financial Institution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-de89031fb05d6268cdaade8e6f8ee037aff51ae412cca50ea016ef150ccff1b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36a51b9c6e3870c095291ddaef64f2cba729c672dfbce57a1e311105f7c0f73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13</data>
