</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNITEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Indemnitee is defined in this context as an individual or entity entitled to indemnification under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Indemnitee includes the Administrative Agent, each Lender, and each Related Party, who is indemnified against liabilities and related expenses arising out of the execution or delivery of the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278f6ba92cd0eaf239dad46b207ebf3b76fc7320e864c3ab7403f1d6bd69eb5</data>
