</node>
<node id="&quot;BAIL-IN LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Regulations that allow authorities to convert debt into equity to stabilize failing financial institutions."&lt;SEP&gt;"the law, regulation, rule or requirement for EEA Member Country implementing Article 55 of Directive 2014/59/EU."</data>
