</node>
<node id="&quot;PERMITTED HOLDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Permitted Holder means, as of any date of determination, the person who is the Company’s Executive Chair on the Closing Date."</data>
