<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Certificate is a document provided by the Lender detailing the amounts necessary to compensate for increased costs due to legal changes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2ec9803c3d1ce225d3e17de0425af729d3c187fa1fb248af233dda60e473eeab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COSTS AND EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Costs and Expenses encompass all reasonable and documented out-of-pocket expenses incurred by the Administrative Agent and its Affiliates related to the agreement's syndication and administration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMENDMENT FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amendment Fees are costs related to modifications made to the original financing agreements or terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTINUING GUARANTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An ongoing agreement where the guarantor remains liable for the borrower's debts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Continued obligation of the guarantor to cover the borrower’s debt."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Person refers to a legal entity defined within the context of the agreement that may include the Company, Borrower, or Lender who has responsibilities or obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal individual or entity that can be involved in the borrowing, lending, or agreement context, potentially subject to obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A natural person or entity that may be involved in assignments but is restricted from becoming a Lender under specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference to any legal or natural entity who undertakes obligations, thus having the capacity to guarantee Indebtedness or other obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or corporate entity referring to those involved in administering rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or entity defined in the document bound by contractual obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or legal entity involved in a transaction or ownership structure."&lt;SEP&gt;"Individuals or entities mentioned in the context of the agreement who are not directly parties to the Agreement but could hold rights based on its conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person is referred to as the Lender party in various contexts within the agreement, indicating a legal obligation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person refers to any legally recognized entity, including individuals and corporations, that may have obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to an individual or entity that has obligations under various agreements, including loans and guarantees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any natural person, corporation, limited liability company, trust, joint venture, association, company, partnership, Governmental Authority, or other entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Person refers to any individual or party involved in the agreement who may have legal responsibilities or obligations under the terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Person serving as the Administrative Agent hereunder may engage in business with any Borrower or Affiliate."&lt;SEP&gt;"means any individual or entity that holds capital leases and their capitalized amounts are recorded on a balance sheet in accordance with GAAP."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-928a1ae0961152b09f4da25a11b845d54b0eee3632984d5b436203de958c27f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e1225c5fdbc1f1d590f8bc86c6948259008fff171a6edcd23aa01eb1514e7f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d3279c6cea71670b97d9c418ae00decf29b16ec16ad6c963df50ed02d5c434b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34479c10f6712b1e76064f05ce54642ca47d753815bd4dfa5c5d91a4cca007f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9638c2b01acba8fc68afa2927208be4b033d37a2af85b73f93461098d18399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64237ca7ee70ecd83f0946b9540617351d1643eee21284e4825864ab52ed6728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e564967161c4b81546b1fdd8e98ad75aed3fc50da1c03eff81ad4a29f868e758&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84af9ccbe90a9c103a2c2207e81856f09e401bfac4b87201be77e022b1fada1d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEBTOR RELIEF LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Debtor Relief Laws provide a framework for resolving obligations and creditor claims when a Borrower is insolvent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Laws refer to legal frameworks that govern the proceedings involving borrowers undergoing financial distress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Includes bankruptcy and similar debtor relief laws applicable in the United States and other jurisdictions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a6bc3c708381cef866299817f572a890eddb432b420457bdedcc3e35bd8b54ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77a409230252918816b5f320c9010f58a33a3992a1995a9ec71618f6028f0a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PENSION ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pension Act means the Pension Protection Act of 2006."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4cb7318cc36cb4d5ea457c2722c50d4571a9695e528ac28a501d14f808c0ef1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JAPAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COUNTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A country in East Asia, known for Yen as its currency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCREASED COSTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Increased Costs refer to the additional financial burdens that impact the Lender as a result of legal adjustments affecting loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2ec9803c3d1ce225d3e17de0425af729d3c187fa1fb248af233dda60e473eeab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELATED PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Related Parties are individuals or entities linked to any Indemnitee, who are protected under the indemnification clause of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Party refers to entities associated with the Administrative Agent or Lender, involved in the financial obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-040bab39da9786ff0f3cafd4425e251c09564b0124c1823abcad4bb4a496cb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROCESSING FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Processing Fees are charges associated with the administrative tasks involved in preparing and managing loan documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RIGHTS OF CREDIT PARTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Details the entitlements of the parties involved in extending credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Outline of rights held by the credit parties in the event of a guaranty."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SYNTHETIC LEASE OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Monetary obligations derived from off-balance sheet or tax retention leases that may not appear in financial statements but represent debt in case of insolvency."&lt;SEP&gt;"refers to capital lease obligations whose amounts are reported on the balance sheet of a Person as a capital lease as per GAAP."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A situation where the Borrower fails to meet the financial obligations set forth in the agreement, impacting their credit status under the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"A situation where the Borrower fails to meet the obligations stipulated in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event or condition that may lead to an event of default under the terms of a loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to the situation when a borrower fails to meet the obligations of the loan agreement, impacting the rights of the Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f51f421f582f9eda4757f24834045c2a926ef032fed106ad64b520d4890cb350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64237ca7ee70ecd83f0946b9540617351d1643eee21284e4825864ab52ed6728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77a409230252918816b5f320c9010f58a33a3992a1995a9ec71618f6028f0a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PENSION FUNDING RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pension Funding Rules means the rules of the Code and ERISA regarding minimum required contributions to Pension Plans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4cb7318cc36cb4d5ea457c2722c50d4571a9695e528ac28a501d14f808c0ef1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;US PERSON'S DEFINITIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Definitions pertaining to entities and individuals classified as U.S. Persons under U.S. law."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 3.04&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 3.04 outlines the compensation requirements for the Lender when facing increased costs due to changes in law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 3.04 pertains to claims for compensation under the terms set within the loan framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 3.04 refers to a specific provision within the Agreement that covers compensation requests from the Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ec9803c3d1ce225d3e17de0425af729d3c187fa1fb248af233dda60e473eeab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OUT-OF-POCKET EXPENSES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Out-of-pocket expenses include costs that are not reimbursed by the Company and which the Administrative Agent or Lender incurs while performing their duties under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM OUT PREMIUMS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Term Out Premiums are additional costs incurred when extending the maturity of existing loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An organization with the power to resolve issues related to the administration of benchmarks, particularly in insolvency scenarios."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity authorized to apply Write-Down and Conversion Powers, impacting the liabilities of Affected Financial Institutions and ensuring adherence to legal frameworks."&lt;SEP&gt;"entities that hold powers to take action regarding failing financial institutions through legal frameworks such as Bail-In Action."&lt;SEP&gt;"means an EEA Resolution Authority or, with respect to any UK Financial Institution, a UK Resolution Authority."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fc294f36b0cf5aa92def8a52cd6a7721bb2bbab7248259f78ef87fa22cdbb2db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36a51b9c6e3870c095291ddaef64f2cba729c672dfbce57a1e311105f7c0f73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An interest rate applied to loans during a default situation, calculated based on the Base Rate plus applicable rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Default Rate is the penalty interest applied to overdue amounts that remain unpaid after the due date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The increased interest rate applied in case of default by the Borrower, as defined in the credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77a409230252918816b5f320c9010f58a33a3992a1995a9ec71618f6028f0a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTAIN WAIVERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conditions under which waivers of specific requirements may be granted."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific waivers that may be granted under various circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE PENSION BENEFIT PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Pension Plan means any employee pension benefit plan, as defined in Section 3(2) of ERISA."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4cb7318cc36cb4d5ea457c2722c50d4571a9695e528ac28a501d14f808c0ef1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRA RULEBOOK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rulebook set by the Prudential Regulation Authority for financial institutions operating in the UK."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 11.10&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Section 11.10 pertains to provisions of the Agreement that may include electronic signatures and conditions for signing."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMENDMENTS, MODIFICATIONS OR WAIVERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Amendments, modifications or waivers refer to any changes made to the provisions of the Agreement or associated Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BANKER’S ACCEPTANCE FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Banker’s Acceptance Fees are costs associated with financing via bankers’ acceptances in the loan process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS INDEPENDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clarification that obligations stand alone and are independent from one another."&lt;SEP&gt;"Confirms that each obligation is independent of others and must be fulfilled separately."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFECTED FINANCIAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A party that may have unsecured liabilities arising under any Loan Document, potentially subject to regulatory actions such as Bail-In or Write-Down."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity currently subject to regulatory sanctions that may affect its ability to operate."&lt;SEP&gt;"any financial institution that is subject to Bail-In Action required by the Resolution Authority as per Bail-In Legislation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ce8b2ab918bc2ac2fae1fd5cbd9e379e3b29035370465def38ddf18fc7e593eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36a51b9c6e3870c095291ddaef64f2cba729c672dfbce57a1e311105f7c0f73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d84bf5327876902f3776604d28990e4f49aa88044f48bb58b3bc30f26cebb13</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Term Benchmark Loan refers to loans structured around established benchmark interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"A loan type with a set interest rate benchmark that impacts terms of repayments."&lt;SEP&gt;"A structured loan arrangement that may be repaid early by the Borrower, subject to conditions and interest payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of loan where the interest rate is linked to a specific benchmark rate over a predetermined term."&lt;SEP&gt;"Different types of loans that bear interest based on specific term benchmarks like SOFR and EURIBOR, used in credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan structured under the terms and provisions specified in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"refers to loans that are referenced against specific benchmark interest rates, such as Term SOFR."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662d9179320cf820c5a366528a40024cf7419d4e2a73a789f30004737c357c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df08587cd1d0a8a19d20b99fcff497b3efe22a9f0038de0d25d64bca428204c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77a409230252918816b5f320c9010f58a33a3992a1995a9ec71618f6028f0a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity that takes part in the financing transaction and may receive a share of the Lender's rights and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Participant shall be entitled to the benefits of Sections 3.01, 3.04 and 3.05 to the same extent as if it were a Lender and had acquired its interest by assignment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Participant has the meaning specified in Section 11.06(d)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4cb7318cc36cb4d5ea457c2722c50d4571a9695e528ac28a501d14f808c0ef1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5837b4e906ab93df88dde035c5e968021e4b88da4155614ac6fd5c04dd10bb7</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CURRENCY EXCHANGE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The rate used to convert amounts from an Alternative Currency to US Dollars based on market rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BOARD OF DIRECTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CORPORATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Board of Directors approves the Agreement and is responsible for necessary corporate action related to the Company."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTION OR DELIVERY OF THIS AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Execution or delivery of this Agreement involves the signing and formal acceptance of the Agreement by the involved parties, which triggers their respective obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BREAKAGE FEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Breakage Fees are penalties or charges incurred for terminating a loan agreement prematurely or early repayment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBROGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The right of the guarantor to step into the lenders' shoes in case of payment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The right of the guarantor to take over the rights of the lender upon payment of the borrower's debt."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate per annum that is defined as the highest between the NYFRB Rate, the Prime Rate, and the Term SOFR for a specific day, used to determine interest rates for loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference interest rate that may be used to determine interest rates for Base Rate Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The foundational reference rate used for calculating interest rates applicable to the loan and subject to change due to Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The minimum interest rate set by a central bank for lending to other banks, used as a reference for calculating interest rates on loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"each Base Rate Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount from the applicable borrowing or conversion date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f901a85d933dee59c32c998d5ea513737e15aac20ae73ca0247bde1f35d2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77a409230252918816b5f320c9010f58a33a3992a1995a9ec71618f6028f0a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EVENT OF DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COVENANTS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A condition defined in the Agreement that, if met, signifies a breach of obligations by the Defaulting Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"A condition or event that, if triggered, allows the lender to demand immediate repayment of the loan or to take other actions specified in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A situation that triggers specific provisions under the Agreement, affecting assignments and consent."&lt;SEP&gt;"A situation where the Borrower fails to meet the obligations under the credit agreement, triggering potential remedies."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term specifying conditions resulting in a borrower default, as noted in Section 8.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"Conditions specified in the agreement that, if met, signify a breach of terms by the Borrower, enabling lenders to take remedial action."&lt;SEP&gt;"Event of Default represents a breach of the terms outlined in the credit agreement, allowing lenders to take action as described in the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-928a1ae0961152b09f4da25a11b845d54b0eee3632984d5b436203de958c27f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d3279c6cea71670b97d9c418ae00decf29b16ec16ad6c963df50ed02d5c434b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff5e2434da655a2671e0dad2380df7ed33831a7ffce6ba8ccd31c237a80d8f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdbf22f96df5a5b375f04f9532b972cb42e1e0c3f7dcfca4233a75700105788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f77a409230252918816b5f320c9010f58a33a3992a1995a9ec71618f6028f0a6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT REGISTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each Lender that sells a participation shall maintain a register on which it enters the name and address of each Participant and the principal amounts of each Participant’s interest in the Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Participant Register has the meaning specified in Section 11.06(d)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b4cb7318cc36cb4d5ea457c2722c50d4571a9695e528ac28a501d14f808c0ef1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5837b4e906ab93df88dde035c5e968021e4b88da4155614ac6fd5c04dd10bb7</data>
