<node id="&quot;ANTONIO MASONE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Antonio Masone is identified as Vice President and Treasurer, managing administrative functions for the agreement on behalf of Amazon.com, Inc."&lt;SEP&gt;"Antonio Masone, as Vice President and Treasurer, is legally bound to fulfill obligations under the five-year revolving credit agreement with Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
