</node>
<node id="&quot;NYFRB RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A rate set by the New York Federal Reserve Bank, used as a component in calculating the Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rate determined based on the Federal Funds Effective Rate or the Overnight Bank Funding Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400</data>
