</node>
<node id="&quot;GIBSON, DUNN &amp; CRUTCHER LLP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LAW FIRM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Gibson, Dunn &amp; Crutcher LLP is the special U.S. counsel to the Company providing legal opinions on matters related to the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8</data>
