</node>
<node id="&quot;VICE PRESIDENT AND TREASURER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The title held by Antonio Masone, indicating authority and responsibility in managing financial agreements for Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-95ae11622a66599a56ed298563b3402533cf258af5e7c68ee3a67ab2e86f5d97</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;STAY OF ACCELERATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Temporary halting of payment acceleration rights following an event of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Temporary suspension of the lender's right to accelerate payment upon a default event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRIME RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Prime Rate is a key interest rate that serves as a benchmark for Base Rate Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate that commercial banks charge their most creditworthy customers, another component used to calculate the Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate of interest last quoted by The Wall Street Journal as the 'Prime Rate' in the United States, with further specifications regarding its determination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Defaulting Lender is a lender that has defaulted under the Agreement and whose rights to approve changes to the Agreement are restricted until resolved."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender is a lender that has failed to fulfill its obligations under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender is a lender that has failed to meet its lending obligations under the terms specified, such as due funding and payment requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that has become unable to fulfill their obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that has failed to fulfill its funding obligations under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that has failed to meet its obligations and is restricted from certain assignments under the provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A lender that has failed to meet its financial obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that is unable to fulfill its obligations under the credit agreement, leading to restrictions on assignment of rights and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"a lender that fails to fulfill its financial obligations as agreed in the contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d3279c6cea71670b97d9c418ae00decf29b16ec16ad6c963df50ed02d5c434b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de89031fb05d6268cdaade8e6f8ee037aff51ae412cca50ea016ef150ccff1b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51f421f582f9eda4757f24834045c2a926ef032fed106ad64b520d4890cb350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdbf22f96df5a5b375f04f9532b972cb42e1e0c3f7dcfca4233a75700105788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-845ee0ce7846a3a47b3352decf9999b720680fae98253ee1de3b3cf5834eb0ae</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIMITED LIABILITY COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A business structure that combines the pass-through taxation of a partnership with the limited liability of a corporation."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of business entity that provides its owners with limited personal liability for debts and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e564967161c4b81546b1fdd8e98ad75aed3fc50da1c03eff81ad4a29f868e758</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FASB ASC 470-20&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"FASB ASC 470-20 is another accounting standard relevant to financial reporting under the obligations of the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHARGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
