</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKOUT, RESTRUCTURING OR NEGOTIATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Workout, restructuring, or negotiations pertain to processes undertaken to address loan defaults or modifications during financial difficulties of the borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTED DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The date when the five-year revolving credit agreement was signed, marking its legal commencement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-95ae11622a66599a56ed298563b3402533cf258af5e7c68ee3a67ab2e86f5d97</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONDITION OF DESIGNATED BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Criteria and conditions established for designated borrowers to qualify under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Requirements and conditions that designated borrowers must meet."</data>
