<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference rate for loans denoting the secured overnight financing rate used in determining interest for Base Rate Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific term rate used as a benchmark for borrowing costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR is a specific benchmark used for funding Term Benchmark Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR is an interest rate benchmark for US Dollar borrowings, determined by the CME Term SOFR Administrator, relevant for setting loan interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The one-month forward-looking rate that reflects the cost of borrowing cash overnight collateralized by U.S. Treasury securities, used in Base Rate calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"each Term SOFR Borrowing shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount for the Interest Period applicable."&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to any Term Benchmark Loan or Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in US Dollars, the Term SOFR."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40</data>
