</node>
<node id="&quot;AFFILIATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Affiliate is a business entity linked to another, typically through ownership or control, which is relevant for the definition of Related Indemnitee."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Affiliate refers to an entity that has a financial interest in the transactions contemplated, potentially enriching the financing arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity related to the Lender, potentially involved in the assignment and transfer of financial rights under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278f6ba92cd0eaf239dad46b207ebf3b76fc7320e864c3ab7403f1d6bd69eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
