<node id="&quot;VICE PRESIDENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TITLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Devin Reasons holds the title of Vice President at WELLS FARGO BANK, N.A., indicating a managerial role within the lending institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lindsay Sames holds the title of Vice President at Bank of America N.A., indicating a senior leadership role in the organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Rhys Yeo holds the title of Vice President at National Westminster Bank Plc, indicating a significant role in the lender's operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Susan Olsen holds the position of Vice President at CITIBANK, N.A., indicating her role and authority in the context of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The title held by Michael King for his role in MORGAN STANLEY SENIOR FUNDING, INC. during the execution of the agreement."</data>
