</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial standard referenced by the Borrower for determining loan conditions based on the Company’s receipt of notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"A general term for the interest rates used as reference points in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference point for interest rates used in financial agreements, particularly loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A standard or point of reference in financial agreements for determining interest rates over a set period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Initially refers to the relevant interest rate used for loans in any agreed currency, changing upon benchmark transition events."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Benchmark refers to the current reference rate used prior to any Benchmark Replacement, which may need to be replaced following a Benchmark Transition Event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc294f36b0cf5aa92def8a52cd6a7721bb2bbab7248259f78ef87fa22cdbb2db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d1cd827703234a2685500f06b6795ba08ba1e0c3e897b909538e908d29dd150</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
