<node id="&quot;DIRECTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TITLE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A director is an individual appointed to oversee the management of a company, relevant under the indemnity framework."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ritam Bhalla holds the title of Director, indicating his position within Amazon.com, Inc. related to the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The position held by Luke Copley at the Bank of Nova Scotia, overseeing the agreement process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5be7021b4ee89d643b02a66b8a79b16c3ace311da7821fa4678ae9c17fc6d6da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278f6ba92cd0eaf239dad46b207ebf3b76fc7320e864c3ab7403f1d6bd69eb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab54d282afa20f44f00b37cd84f11005cd3fdccc4b3be509b64ac7c55cc6a205</data>
