</node>
<node id="&quot;APPOINTMENT AND AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Identification of the administrative agent’s responsibilities and powers under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A mechanism that substitutes a current Benchmark when certain conditions are met in accordance with the terms of the Agreement for the other Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"A provision allowing for the replacement of the current Benchmark under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A reference rate or benchmark that may be replaced by a working group or committee endorsed by central banks or financial authorities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Allows for the modification of applicable benchmark rates during benchmark transition events, ensuring continued relevance of interest calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement refers to the interest rate that is selected to replace a discontinued benchmark interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement refers to the new interest rate benchmark that replaces existing rates under specific conditions, relevant in the context of modifying loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Benchmark Replacement is a new reference rate that will replace the current Benchmark in the event of a Benchmark Transition Event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a1e748e8653f7ee1623da4e71505b6122f8f3542ab87cab1fe18a6b0977ebf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f901a85d933dee59c32c998d5ea513737e15aac20ae73ca0247bde1f35d2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 6.02&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific provision in the legal document defining the meaning of 'Platform', relevant to the agreement context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loans denominated in US Dollars that track the Term Secured Overnight Financing Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans denominated in US Dollars with an Interest Period of one month."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-da0f8ee5eda6ed64227198554e9a303a0636f90e2a487a78516e1751ee90b484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a</data>
