</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest is a financial benefit received by the Lenders from the Loans and Commitments, which may include various payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cost incurred by the Borrower for borrowing funds, expressed as a percentage of the principal amount."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An officer is a high-ranking individual within a corporation or organization responsible for managerial duties, included in the scope of Related Indemnitees."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7278f6ba92cd0eaf239dad46b207ebf3b76fc7320e864c3ab7403f1d6bd69eb5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LINDSAY SAMES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lindsay Sames is identified as a representative of Bank of America N.A. in the context of the credit agreement negotiations, serving in the capacity of Vice President."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-716442a7518cee46449bd436f7a39dee8c3f8cd7fc140d8d453fbaf3585ecf2b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NO OTHER DUTIES, ETC.&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clarifies that the administrative agent has no additional duties outside of those stated in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGREED CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Agreed Currency refers to the currency in which the loans are denominated and must be transacted."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency agreed upon for the transactions that rely on a benchmark."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency agreed upon in the contract for the loans and conversions specified."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which the Benchmark Replacement is denominated, impacting financial agreements and transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which the loan is denominated and which affects the application of adjustments related to the Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified currency in which loans are denominated, affecting the calculation of benchmarks and interest rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fc294f36b0cf5aa92def8a52cd6a7721bb2bbab7248259f78ef87fa22cdbb2db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a1e748e8653f7ee1623da4e71505b6122f8f3542ab87cab1fe18a6b0977ebf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45f901a85d933dee59c32c998d5ea513737e15aac20ae73ca0247bde1f35d2e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EEA RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any public administrative authority or person entrusted with public administrative authority of any EEA Member Country having responsibility for the resolution of any EEA Financial Institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Public administrative authorities within the European Economic Area with powers under Bail-In Legislation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8d506667a8395aa3be8c9d19bd89c9e9e050e1c599089f07ada478b9b6ee4079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7621b6b0260a939bf5232c1f555700bea77e3697504b1f8c45f32dc341d78043</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FEDERAL RESERVE STATISTICAL RELEASE H.15&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A publication that contains data on selected interest rates, including the Prime Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CURRENCIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Alternative Currencies are currencies other than the US Dollar used in specific loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Various currencies in which loans may be denominated apart from US Dollars."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2df08587cd1d0a8a19d20b99fcff497b3efe22a9f0038de0d25d64bca428204c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SETTLEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process of fulfilling obligations to ensure all outstanding amounts under prior agreements are cleared before new loans are granted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An employee is an individual who works for the Indemnitee or any of its subsidiaries or affiliates, mentioned in relation to indemnification."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7278f6ba92cd0eaf239dad46b207ebf3b76fc7320e864c3ab7403f1d6bd69eb5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SIGNATURE PAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal page included in the document indicating the execution status of the revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The SIGNATURE PAGE confirms the consent and acknowledgment of the parties involved in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Signature Page signifies the official completion and acknowledgment of the credit agreement by the involved parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document contains a signature page, which is part of the formal execution process of the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page of the agreement where the parties formally sign to validate the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page that contains the signatures of the parties to the five-year revolving credit agreement, indicating their consent and commitment to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The page where the signatures for the credit agreement are collected to validate the agreement between the parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The section of the credit agreement that includes signatures of the involved parties to authenticate the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page documents the formal acceptance of the agreement by the authorized representatives of the involved parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page indicates the finalization of the five-year revolving credit agreement between Amazon.com, Inc. and U.S. Bank National Association."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page indicates the formal acceptance and execution of the agreement by the pertinent parties, marking an important timeline event in the contractual arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page serves as the final section of the credit agreement where authorized representatives sign to validate the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page serves as the official documentation for the execution of the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page signifies the formal execution of the five-year revolving credit agreement between Amazon.com, Inc. and The Toronto-Dominion Bank."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aae0879d7b3263c1ac3b35db4ae4d3bcfbd3827378d68ac22da3f42dfcc57ab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed2f3a42b192f01bd28081a0632d42d57d7e934196ff7035d9d4662789e4d97f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da6c92de5d9ba0119d12beab582743a1ee5b14977536d24575bce5019ced931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23149313e7a61275777e51d20eb347630f9d42cd5842c8c36acbe20805076817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab54d282afa20f44f00b37cd84f11005cd3fdccc4b3be509b64ac7c55cc6a205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3186497d03f3092b42183853ddc9b9f03466d36a63153a16631500122b8f7ba3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be7021b4ee89d643b02a66b8a79b16c3ace311da7821fa4678ae9c17fc6d6da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a419e80ffb5d939da637620f47c7040f9cc417bded03017a2d6de93d71b69fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716442a7518cee46449bd436f7a39dee8c3f8cd7fc140d8d453fbaf3585ecf2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ee06cf91e33fee41c9599d67414d8c9424c943cafc1d99ea76d0e5fd4a8ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9c433d0b0ff6599fa58c46db2f520a0e1d23e31ea0008c6bf488a82fb27e874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f4e9c5db993c4b6bfb729b65d5bd379d56d03c160564e9cc336a74080157ce1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6bb2f73ec8bb80f8bef7c3d8b584d4d3e2d883de63fc31d3c01c75e62d1ca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d163b342a2ef1c46e4451c99c402b6fb2446cd839b2629e96f9abedd8de95524</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AMENDMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to changes that may be proposed or agreed upon in the context of existing agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'amendments' refers to modifications or additions made to existing agreements, potentially impacting the terms and obligations of the parties involved in a credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b7f66d77f5bfe9a6d041600c174e6e10c32cc8795bc4e86ae5ad61eb30b411c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7343fccfb7a86ee9d25e8d3c6e8bde4e1fc53a0fa2f0026617057a1fb15aade0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR REFERENCE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Term SOFR Reference Rate is the published forward-looking term rate based on SOFR, crucial for determining loan interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate published by CME Term SOFR Administrator at approximately 5:00 a.m. Chicago time, used to determine Term SOFR values for loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERISA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Employee Retirement Income Security Act, which sets standards for pension and health plans in private industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legislation providing inchoate liens related to securing pension liabilities under employee benefit plans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, as amended, and the rules and regulations promulgated thereunder."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d506667a8395aa3be8c9d19bd89c9e9e050e1c599089f07ada478b9b6ee4079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55848c3f3528776bc10163e1eae281a9a0245264a349b24750774dd15c19274c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE IN PRIME RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMMITMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An adjustment that reflects the movement of the Prime Rate as determined by the Administrative Agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AVAILABILITY PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The duration during which Borrowers can draw loans from the Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of adhering to the guidelines and regulations established by governing bodies relevant to the lending process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An agent acts on behalf of the Indemnitee or its subsidiaries and affiliates based on their express instructions, included in the Related Indemnitee definition."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity managing administrative functions on behalf of the Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7278f6ba92cd0eaf239dad46b207ebf3b76fc7320e864c3ab7403f1d6bd69eb5</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEUTSCHE BANK AG NEW YORK BRANCH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Deutsche Bank AG New York Branch serves as the lender in the revolving credit agreement with Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-e1dee774d27c3a7401264c8d35a65e469ac71db3fa8f18c2ac54b3f69d601f5b</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NO WAIVER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"WAIVER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indicates that the waiver of any provision in this context does not imply a waiver of further obligations or provisions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-2b7f66d77f5bfe9a6d041600c174e6e10c32cc8795bc4e86ae5ad61eb30b411c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CME TERM SOFR ADMINISTRATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity that administers the Secured Overnight Financing Rate used as a benchmark interest rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"CME Term SOFR Administrator is the organization responsible for publishing the Term SOFR Reference Rate and its associated methodologies, critical for benchmark determinations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity responsible for publishing the Term SOFR Reference Rate, which is used to calculate Term SOFR rates for financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc294f36b0cf5aa92def8a52cd6a7721bb2bbab7248259f78ef87fa22cdbb2db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ERISA AFFILIATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any trade or business under common control with the Company within the meaning of Section 414(b) or (c) of the Code."&lt;SEP&gt;"The ERISA Affiliate is the entity related to the Company's compliance with retirement and pension plan regulations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-aede7dd5a4f11c6459a462ea51adedbb28d43840ff8a22ee51d31f450a4fd5e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d506667a8395aa3be8c9d19bd89c9e9e050e1c599089f07ada478b9b6ee4079</data>
