<node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference rate for loans denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"An alternative rate that may be used for Benchmark Replacement in relation to Term SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"An interest rate for loans denominated in US Dollars, based on daily SOFR rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SOFR is a benchmark for certain RFR Loans made by the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SOFR is a reference interest rate that is utilized for determining borrowing costs under certain loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"each Daily Simple SOFR Borrowing, if available pursuant to Section 3.03, shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount."&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to any RFR Loan or RFR Borrowing denominated in US Dollars, the Daily Simple SOFR."</data>
