<node id="&quot;CDO RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark rate used in the pricing of Collateralized Debt Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A rate applied to any Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in Canadian Dollars for any Interest Period, determined via the CDO Screen Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Another benchmark interest rate that may be replaced by a Benchmark Replacement in the event of a transition event."&lt;SEP&gt;"CDO Rate is a benchmark applicable to particular Term Benchmark Loans under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"CDO Rate is an interest rate that has been replaced by Benchmark Replacement, indicating its role in the context of transitioning rates in financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The benchmark interest rate for loans denominated in Canadian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"with respect to any Loan or Borrowing denominated in Canadian Dollars, the CDO Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef6c7eda3071071cce06d8e7b726e368033b7ce81b07f5413f242a12d56ea76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a744c62613dd39b4b98c99b873d134698d14f9bc3a6011bf6f579fc72845b831&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40</data>
