  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Rate Limitation is a clause within the Loan Document that specifies conditions under which the interest payment cannot exceed the Maximum Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Outlines limitations regarding the imposition of interest rates under the agreement."</data>
