  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference rate mentioned in the context of Benchmark Replacement relating to Canadian overnight rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term rate that uses the CORRA for interest rate calculation over a specified term."&lt;SEP&gt;"The forward-looking term rate based on the Canadian Overnight Repo Rate Average, important in determining loan interest rates."</data>
