  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the jurisdiction and laws that apply to the agreement's interpretation and enforcement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Governing Law specifies that the Agreement and Loan Documents are construed in accordance with the law of the State of New York."</data>
