<node id="&quot;DAILY COMPOUNDED CORRA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A reference rate for loans denominated in Canadian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"An alternative referencing rate related to Benchmark Replacement options associated with CDO Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Compounded CORRA is the rate applied to outstanding principal from the borrowing date, bearing interest during the applicable Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Canadian Overnight Repo Rate Average for Canadian Dollar denominated loans, accruing on a compounded daily basis."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Canadian Overnight Repo Rate Average, used as a benchmark for calculating interest in loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b1ab24691979572d7f7f2a1bf500f4f9f0a1ef9c39b332d7a9134e52664d46c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5aa2c03b189bfa8ef483975b0359e291d82a6beb7efd71f9e1fbd8af45fe4e</data>
