<node id="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A group of Lenders whose approval is needed to take certain actions upon the occurrence of an Event of Default."&lt;SEP&gt;"A subset of lenders whose approval is necessary for various decisions under the terms of the Loan Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A subset of lenders whose consent is needed for amendments, waivers, or other modifications to the agreement and loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are the group of lenders whose agreement is necessary to extend the Maturity Date and approve amendments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders are the financial institutions or entities that provide the necessary funding as defined in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders are the group of lenders defined within the agreement who have the authority to make decisions regarding the Administrative Agent, including their removal and appointment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders are those whose consent is necessary for the implementation of the Benchmark Replacement and related modifications as defined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders must consent to certain actions regarding the loans, including conversions and continuations during an Event of Default."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, at any time, Lenders having Total Credit Exposures representing more than 50% of the Total Credit Exposures of all Lenders; the Total Credit Exposure of any Defaulting Lender shall be disregarded in determining Required Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0f50b17bab75f31965c93c4d7bd2f14b658481cc3c8810926c4014b58d70bda0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-147a7244e05e5e0a792e28cc6e5a66776b68530e7b78e657803cca8165c2a30c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2d758478b0cf8155d3e94a751c2840e54bd5bf20d852453683cc7e4c195406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51f421f582f9eda4757f24834045c2a926ef032fed106ad64b520d4890cb350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
