  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A condition that triggers the need to replace the existing Benchmark with a Benchmark Replacement as specified in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term describing events that trigger changes in the status of benchmarks within financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"An event that triggers the use of an alternative benchmark rate for loans, as outlined in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Events that signal a need to replace the current Benchmark with a Benchmark Replacement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Events that trigger the need to replace an existing benchmark rate with a Benchmark Replacement in financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Upon occurrence of a Benchmark Transition Event, there are mechanisms for determining an alternative rate of interest."</data>
