  <data key="d1">"TIBO Screen Rate represents the Tokyo interbank offered rate for Yen deposits, indicating how it's used to establish loan interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"the relevant benchmark rate for loans or borrowings denominated in Yen."</data>
