<node id="&quot;SECURITY INTEREST&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal claim or right against the Borrower's assets to secure the loan as agreed by the parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Lender may at any time pledge or assign a security interest in all or any portion of its rights under this Agreement."</data>
