<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "LOAN DOCUMENT" is a comprehensive legal contract that outlines the terms and conditions of loans between the borrower and the lender. It details the obligations of the borrower, as well as the respective rights and responsibilities of all parties involved in the lending arrangement. This legal document encompasses various agreements related to the loan, detailing specific terms, conditions, and obligations, including any amendments, modifications, or waivers that may arise during the loan's lifecycle.

The Loan Document serves as the foundational text for the lending agreement, encapsulating the structure and expectations for both the borrower and the lender. It includes not only the primary agreement terms but also any documentation related to loans provided under the credit agreement, which may cover renewals, extensions, amendments, and refinancings. Additionally, the Loan Document delineates clauses regarding potential defaulting lenders and the obligations of borrowers concerning payment terms, including taxes.

Overall, the Loan Document represents a collection of legal texts that govern the transactions and agreements concerning the loans, ensuring that all parties are aware of their roles and responsibilities in the financing process.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-928a1ae0961152b09f4da25a11b845d54b0eee3632984d5b436203de958c27f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff5e2434da655a2671e0dad2380df7ed33831a7ffce6ba8ccd31c237a80d8f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5837b4e906ab93df88dde035c5e968021e4b88da4155614ac6fd5c04dd10bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-040bab39da9786ff0f3cafd4425e251c09564b0124c1823abcad4bb4a496cb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671f3b38bd6c6bb7fc6cb71e54f93c1747efdf0e7d1d512d7b432bf2cb859443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-520efb27c71261258643d7e53341822e6e3ec69de9e97532a2b9bb4fc458a6c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5d78065cc3e41a4cd16e57e1ecf2b9dd7b8c5201ec5228cb8a44ad16102890&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36a51b9c6e3870c095291ddaef64f2cba729c672dfbce57a1e311105f7c0f73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd13e9cff4b44f1f996d575f0a8ec72755a2ea622bac476546165cd09900b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-618340ed7d36861e000453efe889ea6549fdf4e09d559f128a910d47bca21b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aede7dd5a4f11c6459a462ea51adedbb28d43840ff8a22ee51d31f450a4fd5e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71926bba5cc37a2755872e00f76b4d781b7e713080d4f728381fb8c26ebe6239&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-147a7244e05e5e0a792e28cc6e5a66776b68530e7b78e657803cca8165c2a30c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34479c10f6712b1e76064f05ce54642ca47d753815bd4dfa5c5d91a4cca007f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-300d7b2b96710e2ebf9fe426209554011a187cc446a1d3b492541e9331becd87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da46c95846f2396c5682577e92deca4c73d269171539541fd3c2fb180afeee6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51f421f582f9eda4757f24834045c2a926ef032fed106ad64b520d4890cb350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70b37914c7be727f7cf3b7debe72de6fc09c9ea0cb16e42c919b83d6539e6663&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e50be65db4b6ac7ec46a8f1cad6186244bcd63f2e5df406958ff61986d1b2af4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e19eeb4d91d88a819da58ff7f22334afcbd8b4e79c861858ec896b44ba553485</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "AGREEMENT" is a comprehensive legal contract that delineates the terms and conditions related to borrowing and lending arrangements between the Company, Lenders, Borrowers, and the Administrative Agent. This Agreement specifically addresses the financing provisions, including detailed obligations and rights of the involved parties regarding loans and commitments.

It outlines the specific terms of liability, reimbursement, and the operational obligations of the Borrowers, ensuring compliance with relevant laws. The Agreement serves as a binding obligation, enforceable against the Borrowers in accordance with its terms. Additionally, it includes stipulations concerning the administration of the loans, fiduciary roles, and provisions for Benchmark Replacement, reflecting the dynamic nature of the financial relationships.

The Agreement ensures that Lenders maintain the right to enforce its terms and conditions. It is structured to facilitate the loan process while also covering the mechanisms under which lenders may sell participations related to the credit facility. Overall, the Agreement is a crucial legal instrument governing various transactions among the parties involved, ensuring that all obligations, rights, and conditions related to loan agreements are clearly defined and enforced.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26e344604cf7726d7004ea668272ac6ce202e8a6390a06a6db514777f3cf2f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5837b4e906ab93df88dde035c5e968021e4b88da4155614ac6fd5c04dd10bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-040bab39da9786ff0f3cafd4425e251c09564b0124c1823abcad4bb4a496cb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-520efb27c71261258643d7e53341822e6e3ec69de9e97532a2b9bb4fc458a6c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36a51b9c6e3870c095291ddaef64f2cba729c672dfbce57a1e311105f7c0f73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aede7dd5a4f11c6459a462ea51adedbb28d43840ff8a22ee51d31f450a4fd5e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bb2ac85a5f9618172a8ac2dcefeedec94534f4968718a905d091237f1ee4c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93274523ea8cfdffe9cb49b239093b9b8fd8cc1fcabcf6c7085087dd7bd81fff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a3a25d833dc5c9dbf51acf95e17a8c4594980b2f8443c4b8cd76209f44fc05e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed45c6c96103ab059aceb21c9095ebdb108ab095fa5004a7e6ef0bf873513bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The term "Lender" refers to a financial institution or entity that provides loans under specific agreements. These lenders have defined commitments and obligations as outlined in the credit agreement, which govern the terms and conditions of the loans offered to borrowers. They are required to comply with regulatory obligations, such as the USA PATRIOT Act, which includes identifying borrowers and a commitment to furnishing necessary tax documentation and certifications to the Company and Administrative Agent.

Lenders not only extend financing but also maintain accounts or records of the loans issued and the related repayment activities. They are responsible for the stipulations of the credit agreement, which may entail exercising rights of setoff in case of payment recovery, as well as reviewing applicable documents during the loan process. In their role, lenders have the discretion to respond to requests for extensions or repayments, and they are entitled to collect and receive payments for the loans.

Each lender is identified as a party to the agreement who may pledge or assign rights or security interests in their financing terms. The lenders must also keep the Administrative Agent informed about communication details and maintain a relationship with the borrower throughout the loan period. 

In addition, lenders may seek compensation for increased costs that arise due to changes in law, and they are entitled to reimbursement for documented expenses incurred in connection with the agreement. Furthermore, should there be a default on the part of a borrower, lenders have rights to declare their commitments terminated and enforce remedies.

These lenders can include various financial institutions, such as banks, which can be represented in specific agreements by entities like Bank of America or Bank of China. In the context of lending to specific companies, such as Amazon.com, Inc., lenders operate within the constraints and benefits defined by the credit facility arrangements detailed in the loan documents.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85ef6ac5a1c6b87ea330f630646059e0bb68c988df4982313a1ca1446ecc64c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab54d282afa20f44f00b37cd84f11005cd3fdccc4b3be509b64ac7c55cc6a205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de89031fb05d6268cdaade8e6f8ee037aff51ae412cca50ea016ef150ccff1b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e8504ff4ba8ed9fb6b7bfc804b36759673b68ac8657e9e296cd54aa36268736&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bab89d27ef551b922b5169dcbc7ae230a9d03b5122a39dbe55e516b636b5fa1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5837b4e906ab93df88dde035c5e968021e4b88da4155614ac6fd5c04dd10bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaa7077c66782daef681356b6e76dae16df17215fc1d1321a33b3ecdffbef312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1802684c18fb32d6b6b57dfc8ae152b1f62a6d7e7db1fb9e15d0b2ec9c21a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-040bab39da9786ff0f3cafd4425e251c09564b0124c1823abcad4bb4a496cb18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1841685683abf32e2cb2a9878e3ab222d164d7a7b0358caf1fdac82f1c2a6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f50b17bab75f31965c93c4d7bd2f14b658481cc3c8810926c4014b58d70bda0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e1225c5fdbc1f1d590f8bc86c6948259008fff171a6edcd23aa01eb1514e7f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ea7e8a5a28315835fba0e3fc5139571e7a9e5f6def4698979811859bc6b4d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f39409ba6af7be45cd3c173570b9a98e697daf7a50e484fb20109ec77dceb60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9638c2b01acba8fc68afa2927208be4