<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "BORROWER" refers to an entity that receives loans as per the terms outlined in loan agreements or credit documents. Specifically, this entity is responsible for fulfilling all associated obligations such as repayment and adherence to the covenants specified within these agreements. The Borrower may request loans in various currencies, provided such requests are communicated to the Administrative Agent. 

As a designated party that may include multiple entities, the Borrower is accountable for executing and delivering promissory notes to the assigned lenders. It must comply with legal, regulatory, and tax obligations, often requiring it to provide documentation, including Borrower Materials, to the lenders. The Borrower has specific rights and responsibilities, including repaying the aggregate principal amount of the loans by the designated maturity date.

In relation to its duties, the Borrower operates alongside the Administrative Agent and is obliged to inform about prepayments while ensuring all conditions of the loan agreement are satisfied. It is also required to acknowledge that it will not use the proceeds of the loans in a manner that contradicts Federal Reserve regulations.

Moreover, the Borrower signifies its validity and power to perform obligations through representations made to the Administrative Agent and lenders, such as being duly organized and existing under the applicable laws. This entity encompasses not only the primary corporate entity but also any subsidiaries or affiliates, including those that may involve foreign jurisdictions.

Amid these responsibilities, the Borrower also agrees not to assert claims against the Administrative Agent and must procure necessary approvals or consents for amendments to the agreement, emphasizing the collaborative nature of these financial relationships. In the context of this description, "BORROWER" is explicitly identified with AMAZON.COM, INC. as the party receiving the loan, underscoring the practical application of these responsibilities in real-world lending situations.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85ef6ac5a1c6b87ea330f630646059e0bb68c988df4982313a1ca1446ecc64c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-928a1ae0961152b09f4da25a11b845d54b0eee3632984d5b436203de958c27f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de89031fb05d6268cdaade8e6f8ee037aff51ae412cca50ea016ef150ccff1b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a62e841067104d99b0735c0f8420451b33972e5ad9ef2f9bbc84a3a7a7f3ed5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff5e2434da655a2671e0dad2380df7ed33831a7ffce6ba8ccd31c237a80d8f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d1cd827703234a2685500f06b6795ba08ba1e0c3e897b909538e908d29dd150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e1225c5fdbc1f1d590f8bc86c6948259008fff171a6edcd23aa01eb1514e7f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ea7e8a5a28315835fba0e3fc5139571e7a9e5f6def4698979811859bc6b4d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671f3b38bd6c6bb7fc6cb71e54f93c1747efdf0e7d1d512d7b432bf2cb859443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9638c2b01acba8fc68afa2927208be4b033d37a2af85b73f93461098d18399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-520efb27c71261258643d7e53341822e6e3ec69de9e97532a2b9bb4fc458a6c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5d78065cc3e41a4cd16e57e1ecf2b9dd7b8c5201ec5228cb8a44ad16102890&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36a51b9c6e3870c095291ddaef64f2cba729c672dfbce57a1e311105f7c0f73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76b0dcaa5923e8a3efe5b7dd60fdd987169ebc30843d762c43968ce1c266567d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662d9179320cf820c5a366528a40024cf7419d4e2a73a789f30004737c357c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6f43a6d4ee0d99d1e7746605fb912e7d6fdf643b668f276bcde7c20606febb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a7