<node id="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">LOANS refer to the financial products provided by lenders to borrowers under specific terms outlined in the credit agreement. Each borrower is obligated to repay the aggregate principal amount of loans made to them, with repayment due on the maturity date. These loans, which may involve various amounts and currencies such as US Dollars, Euro, Yen, Sterling, Canadian Dollars, Australian Dollars, and Swiss Francs, are subject to assignment and encompass obligations and compliance with relevant laws.

The loans represent capital extended by lenders to borrowers within the framework of the lending agreements and are documented through notes and maintained records by the lenders and the administrative agent. They entail repayment and prepayment obligations and are part of the structured credit arrangements mentioned in the agreements. Any actions or inactions by defaulting lenders can impact these arrangements, which may also involve pro rata sharing among lenders.

Overall, loans signify the financial resources available to borrowers, governed by the detailed terms and conditions outlined in the loan documents and agreement, reflecting the fiduciary responsibilities of all parties involved in the borrowing and lending process.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c26e344604cf7726d7004ea668272ac6ce202e8a6390a06a6db514777f3cf2f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de89031fb05d6268cdaade8e6f8ee037aff51ae412cca50ea016ef150ccff1b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1802684c18fb32d6b6b57dfc8ae152b1f62a6d7e7db1fb9e15d0b2ec9c21a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2997033e9e9586a5d8ae522596b79da333d35edef15546a52e86c722b6d5025e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fdbf22f96df5a5b375f04f9532b972cb42e1e0c3f7dcfca4233a75700105788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76b0dcaa5923e8a3efe5b7dd60fdd987169ebc30843d762c43968ce1c266567d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d3279c6cea71670b97d9c418ae00decf29b16ec16ad6c963df50ed02d5c434b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6f43a6d4ee0d99d1e7746605fb912e7d6fdf643b668f276bcde7c20606febb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b80e39b102c0c0b1a9da9dae7c4f3d4b5ae278e2f587e6e751ba176e6289abc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0f8ee5eda6ed64227198554e9a303a0636f90e2a487a78516e1751ee90b484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aede7dd5a4f11c6459a462ea51adedbb28d43840ff8a22ee51d31f450a4fd5e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a3a25d833dc5c9dbf51acf95e17a8c4594980b2f8443c4b8cd76209f44fc05e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34479c10f6712b1e76064f05ce54642ca47d753815bd4dfa5c5d91a4cca007f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3587aca38cbbccd56f1fd8186430321564433bb032d54890f0c181d19e314d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df08587cd1d0a8a19d20b99fcff497b3efe22a9f0038de0d25d64bca428204c</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">The "FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT" is a comprehensive legal document entered into by Amazon.com, Inc. with multiple financial institutions, detailing the terms and conditions for a revolving credit facility. This agreement allows Amazon.com, Inc. to draw upon a revolving line of credit over a five-year period, which is designed to provide the company with flexible access to funds as needed.

The parties involved in this credit arrangement include notable banks such as JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A., HSBC Bank USA, Banco Bilbao Vizcaya Argentaria, S.A., Goldman Sachs Bank USA, Standard Chartered Bank, Societe Generale, U.S. Bank National Association, The Hongkong and Shanghai Bank Corporation Limited, Citibank, N.A., Deutsche Bank AG New York Branch, Barclays Bank PLC, and The Toronto-Dominion Bank, among others. Each bank outlines specific terms regarding the lending, borrowing, and repayment obligations of Amazon.com, Inc. 

Dated as of November 1, 2023, this agreement encapsulates the financial arrangement between Amazon and its lenders, providing a structured framework for borrowing and repayment over the five-year duration. The documentation ensures that all parties understand their rights and obligations regarding the provision of credit to Amazon.com, Inc., facilitating a clear pathway for financial operations within the stipulated timeframe. This revolving credit facility underscores the strategic financial planning undertaken by Amazon.com, Inc. to support its operational and growth needs.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ed2f3a42b192f01bd28081a0632d42d57d7e934196ff7035d9d4662789e4d97f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7da6c92de5d9ba0119d12beab582743a1ee5b14977536d24575bce5019ced931&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1dee774d27c3a7401264c8d35a65e469ac71db3fa8f18c2ac54b3f69d601f5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab54d282afa20f44f00b37cd84f11005cd3fdccc4b3be509b64ac7c55cc6a205&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716442a7518cee46449bd436f7a39dee8c3f8cd7fc140d8d453fbaf3585ecf2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaa7077c66782daef681356b6e76dae16df17215fc1d1321a33b3ecdffbef312&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d163b342a2ef1c46e4451c99c402b6fb2446cd839b2629e96f9abedd8de95524&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae0879d7b3263c1ac3b35db4ae4d3bcfbd3827378d68ac22da3f42dfcc57ab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07ee06cf91e33fee41c9599d67414d8c9424c943cafc1d99ea76d0e5fd4a8ee2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7515b4c0ad76dd3f8bf557ca70e9e06f5cd3ef28c2d1c0ad18c9c80d699a5c9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b6bb2f73ec8bb80f8bef7c3d8b584d4d3e2d883de63fc31d3c01c75e62d1ca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23149313e7a61275777e51d20eb347630f9d42cd5842c8c36acbe20805076817&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5be7021b4ee89d643b02a66b8a79b16c3ace311da7821fa4678ae9c17fc6d6da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27d55a9d1b3a3eba3e5b55108c18cc232e505340d34212f0094c6832be84d4dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9c433d0b0ff6599fa58c46db2f520a0e1d23e31ea0008c6bf488a82fb27e874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ae11622a66599a56ed298563b3402533cf258af5e7c68ee3a67ab2e86f5d97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-612062ad01f49c9ca4c50417c5428ad39e99cf1d2baf8214fa478bc725fbb041&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a919fd00d1e4399f1f79049b9dd473ea6388e4ef1b6e1456c32a322d0ba65e59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-417eddcd0bab337766c282a68bfd9bea2d8a4343e248436f5d44e16731bcff52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a419e80ffb5d939da637620f47c7040f9cc417bded03017a2d6de93d71b69fe3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c6c700185acf568ebaf584ceb4698f6f45e5eefd00c2cbfb234890fc302271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f40c94d4d2c8c35be9dad30bb7b9888147e6ad443dea489d08dbdf1c2e5975c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f4e9c5db993c4b6bfb729b65d5bd379d56d03c160564e9cc336a74080157ce1</data>
  <data key="d3">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
