<edge source="&quot;THE BANK OF NOVA SCOTIA&quot;" target="&quot;AMAZON.COM, INC.&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Amazon.com, Inc. is receiving a credit facility from The Bank of Nova Scotia as stipulated in the five-year revolving credit agreement."</data>
