<edge source="&quot;LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">79.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lenders, managing the administrative functions of the Loan Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent agrees to maintain the confidentiality of information shared with the Lenders as part of their responsibilities in managing the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent informs the Lenders about Benchmark Replacement implementations and any adjustments to the terms of the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent informs the Lenders about transactions linked to the Loans and Commitments."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for keeping the Lenders informed about any notices or changes to the Aggregate Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for managing documents required to be approved by the Lenders."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages actions and powers on behalf of the Lenders in relation to the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the administrative functions on behalf of the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the communication and administrative functions between the Lenders and the Company in the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders are represented by the Administrative Agent in all matters regarding the Guarantee Obligations."</data>
  <data key="d6">"administration, management"&lt;SEP&gt;"agent, administering"&lt;SEP&gt;"communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"management, representation"&lt;SEP&gt;"manages actions"&lt;SEP&gt;"represents"&lt;SEP&gt;["confidentiality", "management"]&lt;SEP&gt;["inform", "implement", "changes"]&lt;SEP&gt;["management", "approval"]&lt;SEP&gt;inform&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-92bc0ef3487c16027d11fdb4cbf49715366ff7c084aef20af5c7f4783257a7f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-147a7244e05e5e0a792e28cc6e5a66776b68530e7b78e657803cca8165c2a30c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2997033e9e9586a5d8ae522596b79da333d35edef15546a52e86c722b6d5025e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f666304f992508904d45fa90a054cf11c70cca631bd29a119dce648d89514bc1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff5e2434da655a2671e0dad2380df7ed33831a7ffce6ba8ccd31c237a80d8f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd13e9cff4b44f1f996d575f0a8ec72755a2ea622bac476546165cd09900b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a8c46d23c04f91f1a2faed544f5c146bc4a0b94df1ecef6d74f27e2ec7c98ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e19eeb4d91d88a819da58ff7f22334afcbd8b4e79c861858ec896b44ba553485</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
