</edge>
<edge source="&quot;RECIPIENT&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent ensures that any deductions do not affect the amount the Recipient receives, thereby protecting them from losses due to withholdings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent's responsibilities involve ensuring the Recipient's actions align with the Borrower's obligations regarding tax refunds."</data>
  <data key="d6">"ensures alignment, tax refunds"&lt;SEP&gt;"payment protection, obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-671f3b38bd6c6bb7fc6cb71e54f93c1747efdf0e7d1d512d7b432bf2cb859443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
