<edge source="&quot;AMAZON.COM, INC.&quot;" target="&quot;FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">104.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"AMAZON.COM, INC. is the borrower under the FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT with CITIBANK, N.A."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. enters into a five-year revolving credit agreement with BNP Paribas for financing purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. is a party to the five-year revolving credit agreement that outlines its borrowing terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. is a party to the five-year revolving credit agreement that specifies terms for procuring credit from The Toronto-Dominion Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. is the borrower under the terms of the Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Amazon.com, Inc. is the party receiving funds under the terms outlined in the five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT is specifically tailored for the financing needs of AMAZON.COM, INC."|&gt;"service agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"The FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT outlines the terms of the borrowing by AMAZON.COM, INC."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement outlines the terms under which AMAZON.COM, INC. can access the line of credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement outlines the terms under which Amazon.com, Inc. receives financing.".&lt;SEP&gt;"The Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement pertains to the lending relationship between Bank of America N.A. and Amazon.com, Inc." "&lt;SEP&gt;"The five-year revolving credit agreement establishes the terms under which Amazon.com, Inc. can draw from the credit facility."&lt;SEP&gt;"The five-year revolving credit agreement is entered into by Amazon.com, Inc. to secure financing for operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The five-year revolving credit agreement is executed by Amazon.com, Inc. confirming its commitment to the terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The five-year revolving credit agreement outlines the terms under which Amazon.com, Inc. can access funds from Royal Bank of Canada."</data>
