<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">47.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subsidiaries of the Company are prohibited from receiving assignments under the Agreement's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company oversees its Subsidiaries, which are bound by similar Liens and obligations, creating interconnected financial responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company owns and manages its Subsidiaries as part of its corporate structure."&lt;![CDATA[["owns", "manages"]]&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company's financial performance and covenant compliance affect not only itself but also its Subsidiaries and their financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company’s consolidated financial statements include the financial activities of its Subsidiaries." "&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial results of the Subsidiaries are included in the Company’s financial statements."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Management, Corporate Structure"&lt;SEP&gt;"Prohibition of Assignment"&lt;SEP&gt;"affect, compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"consolidation, financial statements"&lt;SEP&gt;"includes, financial statements"&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-66a5b6127473a9f4242a45cf7f76da3a1c7b00048d778a02556229524f754cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d3279c6cea71670b97d9c418ae00decf29b16ec16ad6c963df50ed02d5c434b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-baf45054e9ce03a6411cf478cf1da76957fd6ed9f67647ddc44a4ada4c52c407&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed45c6c96103ab059aceb21c9095ebdb108ab095fa5004a7e6ef0bf873513bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a</data>
