  <data key="d4">18.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Designated Borrower is obligated to pay additional amounts to the Lender under conditions laid out in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender allows loans to be made to the Designated Borrower through any Lending Office."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides financing to the Designated Borrower as per the agreement terms."</data>
