  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company designates a Subsidiary as a Designated Borrower to receive Loans."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company designates certain Subsidiaries as borrowers under loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is appointed as the agent for the Designated Borrower to receive process regarding the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower is involved in the agreement with the Company for the loan provisions."&lt;</data>
