</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ROYAL BANK OF CANADA&quot;" target="&quot;FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The five-year revolving credit agreement is the framework under which Royal Bank of Canada provides the loan to Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
  <data key="d6">"legal document, agreement"</data>
