<edge source="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK BORROWING&quot;" target="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Term Benchmark Loans are derived from the borrowing mechanisms linked to benchmark rates."</data>
  <data key="d6">"derived from, linked to"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-10e954958658426a2f999194f3230158be979bc90b4cc12f53af4155628dfb6d</data>
