</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK BORROWING&quot;" target="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Term Benchmark Borrowing is defined for specific Interest Periods, which dictate the terms of borrowing."</data>
  <data key="d6">"related to"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-cef6c7eda3071071cce06d8e7b726e368033b7ce81b07f5413f242a12d56ea76</data>
