  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is obligated to repay the Loan, establishing a fundamental borrower-lender dynamic."</data>
  <data key="d6">"loan obligation"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-662d9179320cf820c5a366528a40024cf7419d4e2a73a789f30004737c357c3f</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">20.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender provides Loans under the agreements outlined."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides the Loan to Borrowers based on the specified commitments in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The loan is provided by the lender to the borrower as per the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">"financing arrangement"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides, related to"&lt;SEP&gt;provision&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f43a1e5feb93c9a13d89bc1645dfacba10fe32c9b7c14fc47e0cf9c3ebd480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-769e42748a143e5fd0e034379f2dad5901f83bf76944aa4d070cbf73095a334a</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;SANCTION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loans may be affected by sanctions as determined by regulatory entities."</data>
  <data key="d6">"compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4f69166863c2b4061dfe15a48ff08133a5de14be275508ed5010bd730b3ffa3a</data>
