</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;LIEN&quot;">
  <data key="d4">1.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The lien serves as collateral for the loan, providing security to the lender."</data>
  <data key="d6">"secures, collateral"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-21f43a1e5feb93c9a13d89bc1645dfacba10fe32c9b7c14fc47e0cf9c3ebd480</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LOAN&quot;" target="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Loans can be made in an Alternative Currency subject to the consent of the Administrative Agent and the Lenders." "</data>
  <data key="d6">"currency, consent"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca</data>
