</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company may face actions or proceedings initiated by the Governmental Authority as part of regulatory oversight."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Compliance, Oversight"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-aede7dd5a4f11c6459a462ea51adedbb28d43840ff8a22ee51d31f450a4fd5e8</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
