</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Lender may interact with Governmental Authorities for compliance matters related to the loan and its terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender must comply with laws imposed by governmental authorities that may affect loan agreements."}</data>
  <data key="d6">"Compliance, Regulation"&lt;SEP&gt;"legal compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4f31f96e5682ddadfdc80be4b7efef61d0dfdf44959082fa3a3c9f64c0ee82e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae141e7df14e0e4a6e6cc20f2d0ae5a460cfdb6b5bada2b428f3a3fa46ab9962</data>
