</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LIENS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company has Liens securing Indebtedness related to operating and capital leases, ensuring that lenders can claim assets if obligations are not met."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company has multiple legal liens against its assets to secure payment obligations under various agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company may have Liens on its property or assets to secure obligations arising from existing loans, ensuring lenders are compensated."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Secures, relates to"&lt;SEP&gt;"Securing, Debt, Obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"payment obligations, secure"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-66a5b6127473a9f4242a45cf7f76da3a1c7b00048d778a02556229524f754cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a5d78065cc3e41a4cd16e57e1ecf2b9dd7b8c5201ec5228cb8a44ad16102890&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55848c3f3528776bc10163e1eae281a9a0245264a349b24750774dd15c19274c</data>
