  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;APPLICABLE PERCENTAGE&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Each Lender receives its Applicable Percentage of the payments made by the Borrowers, as calculated based on their share of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Applicable Percentage determines each lender's share of the loans and obligations under the credit agreement."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"proportion, share"&lt;SEP&gt;"receives, allocates"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-a1802684c18fb32d6b6b57dfc8ae152b1f62a6d7e7db1fb9e15d0b2ec9c21a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d</data>
