</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">29.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company has Subsidiaries that are entities under its control, some of which may be significant through regulatory definitions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company holds intercompany indebtedness secured by liens in favor of its Subsidiaries."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is responsible for ensuring that its Subsidiaries maintain their corporate existence and comply with relevant laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company maintains policies affecting both itself and its Subsidiaries."&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">"corporate governance"&lt;SEP&gt;"has, controls"&lt;SEP&gt;"intercompany indebtedness, secured"&lt;SEP&gt;compliance&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-2ea7e8a5a28315835fba0e3fc5139571e7a9e5f6def4698979811859bc6b4d80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-870dfa70e6af38ed1f564245bf845c04bfdf8654adbdd68139ce21074eeb5bcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55848c3f3528776bc10163e1eae281a9a0245264a349b24750774dd15c19274c</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
