</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-CONSENTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Lender may become a Non-Consenting Lender if they disapprove amendments needing consent."</data>
