</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NON-DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Non-Defaulting Lender is characterized as not being a Defaulting Lender at any time."</data>
  <data key="d6">"characterized by default status"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400</data>
