<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">24.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent has authority over assignments related to Defaulting Lenders, ensuring all conditions are met for effective assignment."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender exercises its right of setoff, which requires reporting obligations to the Administrative Agent for application to debts owed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defaulting Lender's payments are managed by the Administrative Agent for various obligations under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Management, Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Setoff, Reporting Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"assignment, compliance"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4fdbf22f96df5a5b375f04f9532b972cb42e1e0c3f7dcfca4233a75700105788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-845ee0ce7846a3a47b3352decf9999b720680fae98253ee1de3b3cf5834eb0ae</data>
