  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">30.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Defaulting Lender is a Lender that has failed to fulfill its funding obligations according to the specified criteria."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender may become a Defaulting Lender if they fail to perform under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defaulting Lender's performance or lack thereof affects the obligations and actions of all Lenders in relation to the Loans offered."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender holds rights against the Defaulting Lender for any unpaid amounts due under the terms of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Impact, Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Unpaid Amounts, Rights"&lt;SEP&gt;"fails to perform"&lt;SEP&gt;relationship_keywords</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4fdbf22f96df5a5b375f04f9532b972cb42e1e0c3f7dcfca4233a75700105788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de89031fb05d6268cdaade8e6f8ee037aff51ae412cca50ea016ef150ccff1b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-845ee0ce7846a3a47b3352decf9999b720680fae98253ee1de3b3cf5834eb0ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6e894a5fb8bb09034f086e85c9ee1a70cedbc4014ea882827cce683623f400</data>
