<edge source="&quot;SIGNATURE PAGE&quot;" target="&quot;FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">46.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SIGNATURE PAGE is part of the FIVE-YEAR REVOLVING CREDIT AGREEMENT that documents the mutual consent of the involved parties."|&gt;"document attachment"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Signature Page confirms the acceptance and finalization of the Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement.".&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page is a component of the five-year revolving credit agreement, confirming its execution by the involved parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page is part of the Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement, indicating agreement by authorized signatories." "&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page is part of the documentation that finalizes the five-year revolving credit agreement between Amazon.com, Inc. and The Toronto-Dominion Bank."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page is part of the five-year revolving credit agreement, confirming that all involved parties have agreed to the terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page serves as confirmation of the parties' agreement to the terms outlined in the five-year revolving credit agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"8"&lt;SEP&gt;"confirms agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"document-part"&lt;SEP&gt;"execution documentation"&lt;SEP&gt;"execution, confirmation"&lt;SEP&gt;Document Structure"&lt;SEP&gt;["amendment", "agreement"]</data>
