<edge source="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">31.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Administrative Agent acts on behalf of Required Lenders when consents are necessary for amendments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Required Lenders when determining adjustments that need to be made regarding the Benchmark Replacement under the terms of the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders hold significant authority to remove the Administrative Agent, underscoring a relationship of control and accountability."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders may request the Administrative Agent to provide specific notifications during events of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders work in conjunction with the Administrative Agent to fulfill the funding requirements outlined in the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d6">"acts on behalf of"&lt;SEP&gt;"collaborate, fulfill requirements"&lt;SEP&gt;"request, notification"&lt;SEP&gt;["act", "determine", "adjustments"]&lt;SEP&gt;control, accountability&lt;</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-0f50b17bab75f31965c93c4d7bd2f14b658481cc3c8810926c4014b58d70bda0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0151e2a43d45881f084b8d7359f2b560d7001a6f72a60060b9136d7cdc17522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6103744a90662e90d48bd1542329aabc2055c94174e6974793f86b7f123c9861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98390e7c10836a84da7c63359d58d6e63f5bc26e2687f8edb83f4b0cd8f4e53a</data>
