  <data key="d4">31.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrower's claims are related to any aspect of the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower enters into a Loan Document to secure a loan with defined terms and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document outlines the obligation of the Borrower concerning payment of taxes."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document outlines the obligations, debts, and liabilities of the Borrower with respect to the Loan."</data>
