  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Agreement is supported by various Loan Documents that detail the operational aspects of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agreement serves as the overarching document encompassing provisions detailed within the Loan Document."</data>
