  <data key="d4">27.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Borrower is legally bound by the terms stipulated in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The designated borrower agrees not to claim immunity in relation to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Agreement is a binding obligation for the Borrower, enforceable according to its terms."</data>
