</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">25.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company is a party to this Agreement, thereby binding it to the terms therein."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is legally bound under the Agreement which outlines its obligations and legal stance concerning operational compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is obligated under the terms of the Agreement, which defines its financial responsibilities and liabilities."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Bound by, Obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligated under"&lt;SEP&gt;"party to agreement"</data>
