</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">43.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Lender retains the sole right to enforce the terms of the Agreement and approve any amendments or waivers.")&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are defined within the agreement, establishing their roles, rights, and obligations toward the borrowers and administrative agents."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender has interests, rights, and obligations as outlined in the Agreement and related Loan Documents."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender is granted rights and obligations defined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender's rights and obligations are directly related to the terms specified in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"contractual obligations, rights"&lt;SEP&gt;"enforce, approve"&lt;SEP&gt;"rights and obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"roles, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;["rights", "obligation"]</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-58c0bae8fcfd224975631aaaec56da60866e29fb6d48da0c39451feabf425c1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5837b4e906ab93df88dde035c5e968021e4b88da4155614ac6fd5c04dd10bb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bb2ac85a5f9618172a8ac2dcefeedec94534f4968718a905d091237f1ee4c2</data>
