</edge>
<edge source="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Administrative Agent plays a central role in executing the terms of this Agreement, managing the Loans and Commitments on behalf of the lenders."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Agreement defines the role and powers of the Administrative Agent in managing the loan documentation and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The administrative agent provides arranging and other services regarding the agreement."</data>
