<edge source="&quot;LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">121.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Company agrees not to assert claims against the Lender based on breach of agency duty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders must deliver executed tax documentation to the Company as per applicable laws."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company compensates the Lender for losses incurred as a result of various loan-related circumstances."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company engages in a borrowing relationship with the Lender, requiring compliance with the Loan Document terms." | ["borrower", "loan"]&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company engages with the Lender to secure funding through the Agreement, outlining terms such as obligations and payments under the arrangement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company has the right to require a Lender to assign its interests to an Eligible Assignee under specific conditions."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is borrowing funds from the Lender and is responsible for repayment under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is borrowing funds from the Lender, which also includes obligations for fees and interest payments."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must manage the relationship and obligations of Lenders and address issues when a Lender becomes a Defaulting Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company notifies the Lender of each determination and has authority to replace Non-Extending Lenders with Eligible Assignees."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company will compensate the Lender for any additional costs incurred due to a Change in Law affecting the loans provided by the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender has the right to request compensation from the Company for any increased costs resulting from a Change in Law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides financing to the Company under the Loan Documents, signifying a borrower-lender relationship."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender's representations and warranties are not for the benefit of the Company or any other Borrower by the nature of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender provides loans to the company under the terms of the agreement, facilitating financial support."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of the Company under the agreement to repay any Loan provided by Lender."</data>
