  <data key="d4">151.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrower agrees not to assert claims against the Lender based on breach of duty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Lender represents to each Borrower that it has developed compliance procedures regarding the use of MNPI in the context of loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders extend their Commitment to the Borrower, ensuring that funds are available as needed under the loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders must respond to any requests made by Borrowers regarding Loans in Additional Alternative Currencies." "&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders provide funds to Borrowers based on agreements, and Borrowers are obligated to repay these funds according to the terms established in the credit agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower acknowledges the obligation to provide materials and comply with loan agreements laid out by the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the entity receiving financing from the Lender under the terms of the credit agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must notify the Lender regarding any payment specifics and consents to terms outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must repay the amount borrowed plus interest to the Lender according to the terms and conditions stipulated in the loan agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender extends loans to the Borrower under the terms set out in the Agreement."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender has certain claims over the Borrower concerning both indemnification of taxes and repayment obligations outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender has obligations to the Borrower regarding the terms outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides Loans to the Borrower, creating a financial obligation for the latter."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides financing to the Borrower as stipulated in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides financing to the Borrower under the agreement, making the Borrower responsible for fulfilling obligations."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides financing to the Borrower under the credit agreement, establishing a lender-borrower relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides financing to the Borrower under the terms of the agreements, establishing a financial obligation."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides loans to the Borrower, which are made available by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship where AMAZON.COM, INC. as the borrower engages with the lender, Bank of China, Los Angeles Branch, for credit support."</data>
