<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">36.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Borrower can make requests for various types of Loans based on currency denominations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are responsible for repaying the loans received from the lenders, in accordance with the agreement terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for repaying the Loans according to the stipulated conditions in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for repaying the Loans as per the terms set out in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower needs to repay Loans made to them by the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives Loans as per the credit agreement, committing to certain repayment terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">"receives"&lt;SEP&gt;"repayment"&lt;SEP&gt;"repayment, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"repays, obligated to"&lt;SEP&gt;"requests"&lt;SEP&gt;"responsibility, repayment"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-faefff1c9baa0aafeeedf0e9558053e64e4a7fc0380942fba82ca5435f681a01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a3a25d833dc5c9dbf51acf95e17a8c4594980b2f8443c4b8cd76209f44fc05e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0f8ee5eda6ed64227198554e9a303a0636f90e2a487a78516e1751ee90b484&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df08587cd1d0a8a19d20b99fcff497b3efe22a9f0038de0d25d64bca428204c</data>
