</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d4">66.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Company provides financial support to the Borrower as outlined in the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must approve or consent to amendments as required by the Company under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is designated as the Borrower, receiving funds from the lenders under the credit agreement's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is identified as the Borrower, responsible for adhering to the obligations specified in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company often serves as the Borrower in the credit agreement, holding the obligation to repay the loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or any other Borrower is required to receive notices regarding the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company oversees the agreements under which the Borrower takes on financial obligations associated with loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company receives financing as the Borrower and has obligations defined by the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company receives notice related to the benchmark from the Borrower."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company, identified as the Borrower, has obligations to repay the Loans provided by the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The company acknowledges the borrower's understanding of the loan transactions."</data>
  <data key="d6">"acknowledgement, loan transaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"approval, consent"&lt;SEP&gt;"borrower definition"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligates"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversight, obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"provides"&lt;SEP&gt;"receives, bound to"&lt;SEP&gt;5&lt;SEP&gt;["financial agreement", "borrower obligations"]&lt;SEP&gt;["notice", "communication"]&lt;SEP&gt;["receiving loan", "obligations"]</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-1e1225c5fdbc1f1d590f8bc86c6948259008fff171a6edcd23aa01eb1514e7f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-520efb27c71261258643d7e53341822e6e3ec69de9e97532a2b9bb4fc458a6c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff5e2434da655a2671e0dad2380df7ed33831a7ffce6ba8ccd31c237a80d8f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51f421f582f9eda4757f24834045c2a926ef032fed106ad64b520d4890cb350&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc131ae3a964914441757eff595809353daad8779a57973721c7705114343eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06558dce15cd58fb44ffaaea2b7ab62e7c540dd6f509ebd8706b13e0c49604e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df08587cd1d0a8a19d20b99fcff497b3efe22a9f0038de0d25d64bca428204c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21f43a1e5feb93c9a13d89bc1645dfacba10fe32c9b7c14fc47e0cf9c3ebd480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d1cd827703234a2685500f06b6795ba08ba1e0c3e897b909538e908d29dd150</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
