</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">144.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"A Borrower must request the Loans to be made in currencies other than US Dollars to the Administrative Agent." "&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower agrees not to assert claims against the Administrative Agent based on breach of duty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower requires the cooperation of the Administrative Agent to contest tax responsibilities, affecting financial obligation management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower represents its qualifications and authority to the Administrative Agent in relation to its obligations under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Borrower for managing and executing loan obligations and communications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent can accept deposits, lend money, and engage in business dealings with any Borrower or their Affiliates."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent cooperates with the Borrower to contest Indemnified Taxes as needed, involving expenses for the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent distributes the amounts due from Borrowers to Lenders, assuming payments are made unless notified otherwise."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates communication with the Borrower for notices and updates related to the loan agreement."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent files claims on behalf of the Borrower in judicial proceedings to protect the interests of the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is authorized to make tax withholdings from payments made by the Borrower as required by the law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower communicates changes in address and contact details to the Administrative Agent to maintain accurate records for notifications."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower communicates with the Administrative Agent regarding compliance and handling of non-public information relating to the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is obligated to make payments through the Administrative Agent who is responsible for withholding taxes as required by law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is required to execute and deliver notes to the assignee Lender upon request by the Administrative Agent."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must communicate with the Administrative Agent to satisfy commitments outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must notify the Administrative Agent regarding prepayments, indicating a command structure in loan management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must provide payment evidence to the Administrative Agent after any payment of Taxes."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower needs to communicate with the Administrative Agent in terms of receiving and sending notices regarding terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"While the Administrative Agent acts for the Lenders, their actions pertain to the Borrower’s obligations under the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Evidence of Payments"&lt;SEP&gt;"Payment Distribution"&lt;SEP&gt;"acts for, manages"&lt;SEP&gt;"agreement, duty breach"&lt;SEP&gt;"communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"cooperates, challenges"&lt;SEP&gt;"engagement, business dealings"&lt;SEP&gt;"execution, compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"files, represents"&lt;SEP&gt;"manages borrower's obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation, administrative function"&lt;SEP&gt;"prepayment notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"represents, warrants"&lt;SEP&gt;"request, notify"&lt;SEP&gt;"requires cooperation, contesting"&lt;SEP&gt;"tax withholding, administrative role"&lt;SEP&gt;["communication", "notice"]&lt;SEP&gt;["obligation", "communication"]&lt;SEP&gt;communication facilitation&lt;SEP&gt;communication update</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-40560da6e1561d9b7bbc87da2fb1251546ce2526102f0f961d2c1a4ce09d2d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42d0ef1a853dfae1ebeda59d8a271d919e3401384ff07dde2d60832a2bc531d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85ef6ac5a1c6b87ea330f630646059e0bb68c988df4982313a1ca1446ecc64c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a3a25d833dc5c9dbf51acf95e17a8c4594980b2f8443c4b8cd76209f44fc05e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d56dda0147dd68b2af364fb05bca3afd058d2e2234710a1515b9db9836ea6ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e1225c5fdbc1f1d590f8bc86c6948259008fff171a6edcd23aa01eb1514e7f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-662d9179320cf820c5a366528a40024cf7419d4e2a73a789f30004737c357c3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671f3b38bd6c6bb7fc6cb71e54f93c1747efdf0e7d1d512d7b432bf2cb859443&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6f43a6d4ee0d99d1e7746605fb912e7d6fdf643b668f276bcde7c20606febb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d979858856143135b0bd6a2b56abe1c0f008a76e28fc68328fca1227e51d52a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9638c2b01acba8fc68afa2927208be4b033d37a2af85b73f93461098d18399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8991cd9ed9ee197640df0ae2da83d3076642e19ac632e7680d69e182501d14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64237ca7ee70ecd83f0946b9540617351d1643eee21284e4825864ab52ed6728&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-300d7b2b96710e2ebf9fe426209554011a187cc446a1d3b492541e9331becd87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a36a51b9c6e3870c095291ddaef64f2cba729c672dfbce57a1e311105f7c0f73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed45c6c96103ab059aceb21c9095ebdb108ab095fa5004a7e6ef0bf873513bc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f8c4736ec9a956967fd71cc423e20057296a32f721a9c65287373540618cfd0</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
  <data key="d9">&lt;r&gt;</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Company has an obligation regarding Loans and interacts with Defaulting Lenders as specified in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Obligation, Interaction"</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-4fdbf22f96df5a5b375f04f9532b972cb42e1e0c3f7dcfca4233a75700105788</data>
  <data key="d8">DOC-5619df3ed8174d0d8a59a7c69c0d2e4d08b31bfa20e08b964330e5d3d2b5c6eb</data>
