</edge>
<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">159.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Company agrees not to assert claims against the Administrative Agent based on breach of agency duty."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent delivers documentation to the Company regarding payments made to Governmental Authorities."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent interacts with the Company to facilitate the smooth administration of the agreement and ensure compliance."}&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for facilitating communication between the Company and the Lenders regarding extension requests."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the administrative functions and compliance for the loans received by the Company.")&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent may consult with legal counsel and other experts to assist in managing the agreement with the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent notifies the Company of any Benchmark Transition Event or changes in the Benchmark Replacement under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent notifies the Company regarding the status and agreements related to Defaulting Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company communicates with the Administrative Agent regarding its funding obligations and any defaults from the Lender."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company indemnifies the Administrative Agent against liabilities and holds it harmless from any related expenses incurred in connection with the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is required to send and receive notices from the Administrative Agent concerning the credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company may remove or appoint the Administrative Agent with the consent of the Required Lenders, outlining a governance relationship."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must deliver financial statements to the Administrative Agent for distribution to Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must notify the Administrative Agent of any Default occurrence as soon as a Responsible Officer has actual knowledge of it."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must pay fees to the Administrative Agent on or before the Closing Date as part of its obligations under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company notifies the Administrative Agent regarding any decisions to terminate or reduce Aggregate Commitments, initiating processing of changes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company pays a commitment fee to the Administrative Agent for managing the loan functions on behalf of Lenders."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company relies on the Administrative Agent for the management of its obligations and rights under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company requires the Administrative Agent's consent for certain assignments; this consent is not to be unreasonably withheld."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company works closely with the Administrative Agent to manage loan agreements and ensure adherence to their terms."</data>
  <data key="d6">"Documentation Delivery"&lt;SEP&gt;"Notification, Agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Requires Consent"&lt;SEP&gt;"agreement, duty breach"&lt;SEP&gt;"consultation, assistance"&lt;SEP&gt;"facilitation, communication"&lt;SEP&gt;"fees, obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"indemnification"&lt;SEP&gt;"management, compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"management, notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"management, reliance"&lt;SEP&gt;"notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"reporting"&lt;SEP&gt;["notice", "communication"]&lt;SEP&gt;["notify", "terms", "event"]&lt;SEP&gt;administrative facilitation&lt;SEP&gt;governance, appointment&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;management"&lt;SEP&gt;payment&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;relationship_keywords</data>
